hadiths[103]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1","[AI-translation] ´Abu Jamra kehtay hain ke` mein Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ke saamnay un ke aur logon ke baich mein mutarjim tha (yani auron ki baat ko Arabi mein tarjuma kar ke Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ko samjhata) itnay mein aik aurat aayi aur gharay ke nabeez ke baara mein poocha Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha ke Abdul Qais ke wafd Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaye to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne poocha ke ye wafd kaun hain ya kis qaum ke log hain logon ne kaha ke Rabia ke log hain Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke marhaba ho qaum ya wafd ko jo na ruswa hue na sharminda hue (kyunke baghair larai ke khud Musalman honay ke liye aaye agar larai ke baad Musalman hotay to wo ruswa hotay londi ghulam binaye jatay maal lut jata to sharminda hotay) un logon ne kaha Ae Allah ke Rasool ! ham Aap ke paas door lambi se safar kar ke aatay hain aur hamaray aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke darmiyan mein kafiron ka qabeela Muzar hai to ham nahi aa saktay Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam tak magar hurmat walay maheena mein (jab laut maar nahi hoti) us liye ham ko hukm kijiye aik saaf baat ka jis ko ham batlayein aur logon ko bhi aur jayein us ke sabab se jannat mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne un ko chaar baaton ka hukm kiya aur chaar baaton se mana farmaya un ko hukm kiya Allah wahdah la shareek par iman lanay ka aur un se poocha ke tum jantay ho ke iman kiya hai unhon ne kaha ke Allah aur us ka Rasoolullah khoob janta hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke iman gawahi dena hai us baat ki ke siwa Allah ke koi ibadat ke laiq nahi aur beshak Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam us ke bhejay hue hain aur namaz ka qaim karna aur zakaat ka dena aur Ramazan ke rozay rakhna (ye chaar baatein ho gayein ab aik paanchwin baat aur hai) aur ghaneemat ke maal mein se paanchwin hissa ka ada karna (yani kuffaar ki sipaah ya Musalmanon ke khilaf larnay walon se jo maal hasil ho maal ghaneemat kehlata hai) aur mana farmaya un ko kaddu ke bartan sabz gharay aur roghni bartan se (Shuba ne) kabhi yun kaha aur naqeer se aur kabhi kaha muqayyar se (yani lakri se binaye hue bartan hain) aur farmaya ke us ko yaad rakho aur un baaton ki un logon ko bhi khabar do jo tumharay peechay hain aur Abu Bakr bin Abu Shaiba ne ((Nabi waraakum)) kaha badlay ((Nabi waraakum)) ke (un donon ka matlab aik hi hai) aur bin Muaz raziyallahu anhu ne apni riwayat mein apne baap se itna zyada kiya ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Abdul Qais ke Ashajj se (jis ka naam Munzir bin Haris bin Ziyad tha ya Munzir bin Ubaid ya A'iz bin Munzir ya Abdullah bin Auf tha) farmaya ke tujh mein do aadatein aisi hain jin ko Allah Taala pasand karta hai aik to aqalmandi doosray dair mein soch samajh kar kaam karna jaldi na karna"
"2","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aik din logon mein baithay thay ke itnay mein aik shakhs aaya aur bola Ae Allah ke Rasool ! iman kise kehtay hain Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke iman ye hai ke to yaqeen karay dil se Allah par aur us ke farishton par aur us ki kitabon par aur us se milnay par aur us ke paighambaron par aur yaqeen karay qayamat mein zinda honay par phir wo shakhs bola ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Islam kiya hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Islam ye hai ke to Allah Jal Jalaluhu ko poojay aur us ke saath kisi ko shareek na karay aur qaim karay to farz namaz ko aur de to zakaat ko jis qadar farz hai aur rozay rakhay Ramazan ke phir wo shakhs bola ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! ehsaan kise kehtay hain Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke to ibadat karay Allah ki jaisay ke to usay dekh raha hai agar to us ko nahi dekhta (yani tawajjuh ka ye darja na ho sakay) to itna to ho ke wo tujhe dekh raha hai phir wo shakhs bola Ae Allah ke Rasool ! qayamat kab ho gi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke jis se poochtay ho qayamat ko wo poochnay walay se zyada nahi janta lekin us ki nishaniaan mein tujh se bayan karta hun ke jab londi apne Maalik ko jine to ye qayamat ki nishani hai aur jab nangay badan nangay paon phirnay walay log sardar binein to ye qayamat ki nishani hai aur jab bakriyan ya bheerein charaanay walay bari bari imaaratein banayein to ye bhi qayamat ki nishani hai qayamat un paanch cheezon mein se hai jin ko koi nahi janta siwa Allah Taala ke phir Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ye aayat padhi ke ” Allah hi janta hai qayamat ko aur wohi utaarta hai pani ko aur janta hai jo kuch maan ke rehem mein hai (yani maulood naik hai ya bad rizq kitna hai Umar kitni hai waghera) aur koi nahi janta ke wo kal kiya karay ga aur koi nahi janta ke wo kis mulk mein maray ga Allah hi jannay wala aur khabardaar hai “ (Surah : Luqman : 34) phir wo shakhs peeth mor kar chala gaya to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke us ko phir wapas le aao log us ko lenay chalay lekin wahan kuch na paya (yani us shakhs ka nishan bhi na mila) tab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke wo Jibrail alaihissalam thay tum ko deen ki baatein sikhlaanay aaye thay"
"3","[AI-translation] ´Sa'eed bin Musayyab (jo mashhoor taabein mein se hain) apne walid (Musayyab raziyallahu anhu bin Huzn bin Amr bin aabid bin Imran bin Makhzoom Qurashi Makhzoomi jo ke sahabi hain) se riwayat kartay hain ke` unhon ne kaha ke jab Abu Talib bin Muttalib (Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke haqeeqi chacha aur murabbi) marnay lagay to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam un ke paas tashreef laaye aur wahan Jahl (Amr bin Hisham) aur Abdullah bin Abu Umayya bin Mughira ko baitha dekha Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ae chacha tum aik kalima la ilaah illa Allah keh do mein Allah ke paas us ka gawah rahun ga tumharay liye (yani Allah Azza wa Jal se qayamat ke roz arz karun ga ke Abu Talib muwahhid thay aur un ko jahannam se nijaat honi chahiye unhon ne aakhir waqt mein kalima tauheed ka iqraar kiya tha) Jahl aur Abdullah bin Abu Umayya bolay ke Ae Abu Talib ! Muttalib ka deen chhortay ho aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam barabar yehi baat un se kehtay rahay (yani kalima tauheed padhnay ke liye aur idhar Jahl aur Abdullah bin Abu Umayya apni baat biktay rahay) yahan tak ke Abu Talib ne aakhir baat jo ki wo ye thi ke mein Muttalib ke deen par hun aur inkar kiya la ilaah illa Allah kehnay se to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Allah ki qasam mein tumharay liye dua karun ga (bakhshish ki) jab tak ke mana na ho tab Allah Taala ne ye aayat utari ” paighambar aur doosray Musalmanon ko jaaiz nahi ke mushrikeen ke liye maghfirat ki dua maangein agarchay wo rishta daar hi hun us amr ke zaahir ho janay ke baad ke ye log dozakhi hain “ (Surah : Tauba : 113) aur Allah Taala ne Abu Talib ke baaray mein ye aayat utari Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se farmaya ke ” Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jisay chahein hidayat nahi kar saktay balke Allah Taala hi jisay chahay hidayat karta hai hidayat walon se wohi khoob aagaah hai “ (Surah : al-Qasas : 56)"
"4","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` jab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne wafaat paayi aur Abu Bakr Siddiq raziyallahu anhu khaleefa hue aur Arab ke log jo kafir honay thay wo kafir ho gaye to Umar raziyallahu anhu ne Abu Bakr Siddiq raziyallahu anhu se kaha ke tum un logon se kaisay laro ge halanke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke ” mujhe hukm hua hai logon se larnay ka yahan tak ke wo la ilaah illa Allah kahein phir jis ne la ilaah illa Allah kaha us ne mujh se apne maal aur jaan ko bacha liya magar kisi haq ke badlay (yani kisi qasoor ke badlay jaisay zina karay ya khoon karay to pakra jaye ga) phir us ka hisab Allah par hai “ (agar us ke dil mein kufr hua aur zaahir mein darr ke maaray Musalman ho gaya ho to qayamat mein Allah us se hisab le ga duniya zaahir par hai duniya mein us se koi muakhaza na ho ga) Abu Bakr Siddiq raziyallahu anhu ne kaha Allah ki qasam mein to laron ga us shakhs se jo farq karay namaz aur zakaat mein us liye ke zakaat maal ka haq hai Allah ki qasam agar wo aik iqaal rokein ge jo diya kartay thay Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko to mein laron ga un se us ke na denay par Umar raziyallahu anhu ne kaha Allah ki qasam phir wo kuch na tha magar mein ne yaqeen kiya ke Allah Jal Jalaluhu ne Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ka seena khol diya hai larai ke liye (yani un ke dil mein ye baat daal di) tab mein ne jaan liya ke yehi haq hai"
"5","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mujhe hukm hua hai logon se larnay ka yahan tak ke wo gawahi dein us baat ki ke koi mabood barhaq nahi siwae Allah Taala ke aur beshak Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us ke Rasool hain aur namaz qaim karein aur zakaat dein phir jab ye karein to unhon ne mujh se apni jaanon aur maalon ko bacha liya magar haq ke badlay aur un ka hisab Allah Taala par hai"
"6","[AI-translation] ´Miqdad bin Aswad raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha` Ae Allah ke Rasool ! agar mein aik kafir se bhiron wo mujh se laray aur mera aik haath talwaar se kaat daalay phir mujh se bach kar aik darakht ki aar le le aur kehnay lagay ke mein taabe ho gaya Allah ka to kiya mein us ko qatl kar dun jab wo ye baat keh chukay to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke us ko mat qatl kar mein ne kaha Ae Allah ke Rasool ! us ne mera haath kaat daalnay phir aisa kehnay laga to kiya mein us ko qatl karun Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke us ko qatl mat kar (agarchay tujh ko us se sadma pahuncha aur zakhm laga) agar to us ko qatl karay ga to us ka haal tera sa ho ga qatl se pehle aur tera haal us ka sa ho ga jab tak us ne ye kalima nahi kaha tha"
"7","[AI-translation] ´Usama bin Zaid (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne hamein aik sarya mein bheja ham subah ko Huraqaat se laray jo Juhaniya mein se hai phir mein ne aik shakhs ko paya us ne la ilaah illa Allah kaha mein ne barchhi se us ko maar diya us ke baad mere dil mein wahm hua (ke la ilaah illa Allah kehnay par maarna durust na tha) mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se bayan kiya to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke kiya us ne la ilaah illa Allah kaha tha aur to ne us ko maar daalnay mein ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! us ne hathiyar se darr karkeha tha Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke to ne us ka dil cheer kar dekha tha taake tujhe maloom hota ke us ke dil ne ye kalima kaha tha ya nahi (matlab ye hai ke dil ka haal tujhe kahan se maloom hua) phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam baar yehi farmatay rahay yahan tak ke mein ne aarzu ki ke Kaash mein usi din Musalman hua hota (to Islam lanay ke baad aisay gunah mein mubtala na hota kyunke Islam lanay se kufr ke aglay gunah maaf ho jatay hain) Sa'd bin Abu Waqqas (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam mein kisi Musalman ko na maaron ga jab tak us ko Zul-Batain yani Usama na maaray aik shakhs bola ke kiya Allah Taala ne ye nahi farmaya hai : ” aur tum un se us had tak laro ke un mein fasaad aqeeda (shirk but parasti) na rahay aur deen Allah hi ka ho jaye “ to Sa'd raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke ham to (kafiron se) us liye laray ke fasaad na ho aur to aur tere saathi us liye lartay hain ke fasaad ho"
"8","[AI-translation] ´Safwan bin Mehraz se riwayat hai ke` Jundub bin Abdullah bijli raziyallahu anhu ne As'as bin Salaama ko kehla bheja jab Abdullah bin Zubair raziyallahu anhu ka fitna hua ke tum apne chand bhaiyon ko ikaththa karo taake mein un se baatein karun As'as ne logon ko kehla bheja wo ikathay hue to Jundub raziyallahu anhu aaye aik zard burnus orhay hue thay (burnus wo topi hai jisay log shuru zamana Islam mein pehantay thay) unhon ne kaha ke tum baatein karo jo kartay thay yahan tak ke Jundub raziyallahu anhu ki baari aayi (yani un ko baat zaroor karna pari) to unhon ne burnus apne sar se hata diya aur kaha ke mein tumharay paas sirf us iraaday se aaya hun ke tum se tumharay paighambar ki hadees bayan karun Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Musalmanon ka aik lashkar mushrikon ki aik qaum par bheja aur wo donon milay (yani aamna saamna hua maidaan jang mein) to mushrikon mein aik shakhs tha wo jis Musalman par chahta us par hamla karta aur maar leta aakhir aik Musalman ne us ko ghaflat (ki haalat mein) dekha aur logon ne ham se kaha (ke) wo Musalman Usama bin Zaid (raziyallahu anhu) thay phir jab unhon ne talwaar us par seedhi ki to us ne kaha la ilaah illa Allah lekin unhon ne usay maar daalnay us ke baad qaasid khushkhabri le kar Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaya Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us se haal poocha us ne sab haal bayan kiya yahan tak ke us shakhs ka bhi haal kaha to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne un ko bulaya aur poocha ke tum ne kyun us ko maara Usama raziyallahu anhu ne kaha Ae Allah ke Rasool ! us ne Musalmanon ko bohat takleef di falan aur falan ko maara aur kai aadmiyon ka naam liya phir mein us par ghalib hua jab us ne talwaar ko dekha to la ilaah illa Allah kehnay laga Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya tum ne us ko qatl kar diya unhon ne kaha haan Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tum kiya jawab do ge la ilaah illa Allah ka jab wo qayamat ke din aaye ga unhon ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! mere liye bakhshish ki dua kijiye ! Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya tum kiya jawab do ge la ilaah illa Allah ka jab wo qayamat ke din aaye ga phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us se zyada kuch na kaha aur yehi kehtay rahay ke tum kiya jawab do ge la ilaah illa Allah ka jab wo qayamat ke din aaye ga"
"9","[AI-translation] ´Usman raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke jo shakhs mar jaye aur us ko us baat ka yaqeen ho ke koi ibadat ke laiq nahi siwae Allah Jal Jalaluhu ke to wo jannat mein jaye ga"
"10","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) (ya Abu Sa'eed (raziyallahu anhu)) se riwayat hai (ye A'mash raziyallahu anhu ko jo ke us hadees ke rawi hain shak hai) ke` jab ghazwa Tabook ka waqt aaya (Tabook mulk shaam mein aik muqaam ka naam hai) to logon ko sakht bhook lagi unhon ne kaha Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Kaash Aap hamein ijazat detay to ham apne oonton ko jin par pani laatay hain zabah kartay gosht khatay aur charbi ka tail banatay Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : acha kar lo itnay mein Umar raziyallahu anhu aaye aur unhon ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! agar aisa karein ge to sawaariaan kam ho jayein gi (us ke bajaye) Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam tamam logon ko bila bhejye aur keye ke apna apna bacha hua tosha le kar aayein phir Allah se dua kijiye tosha mein barkat de shayad us mein Allah koi rasta nikaal de (yani barkat aur behtari ataa farmaye) Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya acha phir aik dastarkhwan mangwaya aur us ko bichha diya aur sab ka bacha hua tosha mangwaya koi mutthi bhar jiwaar laya aur koi mutthi bhar khajoor laya koi roti ka tukra yahan tak ke sab mil kar thora sa dastarkhwan par ikaththa hua phir Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne barkat ke liye dua ki us ke baad Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke apne apne bartanon mein tosha bharo to sabhi logon ne apne apne bartan bhar liye yahan tak ke lashkar mein koi bartan na chhora jis ko na bhara ho phir sab ne khana shuru kiya aur sair ho gaye us par bhi kuch bach raha tab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mein gawahi deta hun us baat ki ke Allah Taala ke siwa koi sacha mabood nahi aur mein Allah ka bheja hua Rasool hun jo shakhs un donon baaton par yaqeen kar ke Allah se milay ga wo jannat se mehroom na ho ga"
"11","[AI-translation] ´Sanaabihi Ubada bin Samit (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat kartay hain ke` mein un ke paas gaya aur wo us waqt qareeb ul marg thay mein ronay laga to unhon ne kaha ke thehro rotay kyun ho Allah ki qasam agar mein gawah banaya jaun ga to tere liye (iman ki) gawahi dun ga aur agar meri sifarish kaam aaye gi to teri sifarish karun ga aur agar mujhe taqat ho gi to tujh ko faida dun ga phir kaha Allah ki qasam nahi koi aisi hadees jo ke mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suni aur us mein tumhari bhalayi thi magar ye ke mein ne usay tum se bayan kar diya albatta aik hadees mein ne ab tak bayan nahi ki wo aaj bayan karta hun us liye ke meri jaan janay ko hai mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke jo shakhs gawahi de (yani dil se yaqeen karay aur zubaan se iqraar) ke Allah ke siwa koi sacha mabood nahi aur beshak Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Allah ke Rasool hain to Allah Taala us par jahannam ko haraam kar de ga (yani hamesha jahannam mein rehnay ko ya jahannam ke us tabaqa ko jis mein hamesha rehnay walay kafir daalay jayein ge)"
"12","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` ham Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke gird baithay thay aur hamaray saath aur aadmiyon mein Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) aur Umar raziyallahu anhu bhi thay itnay mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam uthay (aur bahar tashreef le gaye) phir Aap ne hamaray paas aanay mein dair lagayi to ham ko darr hua ke kahein dushman Aap ko akeela paa kar maar na daalein ham ghabra gaye aur uth kharay hue sab se pehle mein ghabraya to mein Aap ko dhoondnay ke liye nikla aur Bani Najjar ke baagh ke paas pahuncha (Bani Najjar Ansaar ke qabeelon mein se aik qabeela tha) us ke chaaron taraf darwaza ko dekhta hua phira ke darwaza paon to andar jaun (kyunke gumaan hua ke shayad Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam us ke andar tashreef le gaye hun) darwaza mila hi nahi (shayad us baagh mein darwaza hi na ho ga ya agar ho ga to Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ko ghabrahat mein nazar na aaya ho ga) dekha ke bahar kunwein mein se aik naali baagh ke andar jati hai mein lomri ki tarah simat kar us naali ke andar ghusa aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas pahuncha Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke kiya Abu Huraira hai mein ne arz kiya ji Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke kiya baat hai mein ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Aap ham logon mein tashreef rakhtay thay phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam bahar chalay aaye aur wapas aanay mein dair lagayi to hamein darr hua ke kahein dushman Aap ko ham se juda dekh kar na satayein ham ghabra gaye aur sab se pehle mein ghabra kar utha aur us baagh ke paas aaya (darwaza na mila) to us tarah simat kar ghus aaya jaisay lomri apne badan ko samait kar ghus jati hai aur sab log mere peechay aaye hain Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ae Abu Huraira ! aur mujhe apne jootay (nishani ke liye) diye (taake log meri baat ko sach samajhein) aur farmaya ke meri ye donon jootiyan le ja aur jo koi tujhe us baagh ke peechay milay aur wo us baat ki gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood barhaq nahi aur us baat par dil se yaqeen rakhta ho to us ko ye suna kar khush kar de ke us ke liye jannat hai (Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke mein jootiyan le kar chala) to sab se pehle mein Umar raziyallahu anhu se mila unhon ne poocha ke Ae Abu Huraira ye jootiyan kaisi hain mein ne kaha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki jootiyan hain Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ye de kar mujhe bheja hai ke mein jis se milon aur wo la ilaah illa Allah ki gawahi deta ho dil se yaqeen kar ke to us ko jannat ki khushkhabri dun ye sun kar Umar raziyallahu anhu ne aik haath meri chhaati ke baich mein maara to mein sireen ke bal gira phir kaha ke Ae Abu Huraira ! laut ja mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas laut kar chala gaya aur ronay wala hi tha ke mere saath peechay se Umar raziyallahu anhu bhi aa pahunche Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ae Abu Huraira ! tujhe kiya hua mein ne kaha ke mein Umar raziyallahu anhu se mila aur jo paigham Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mujhe de kar bheja tha pahunchaya to unhon ne meri chhaati ke baich mein aisa maara ke mein sireen ke bal gir para aur kaha ke laut ja Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Umar raziyallahu anhu se kaha ke to ne aisa kyun kiya unhon ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ! Aap par mere maan baap qurban hun Abu Huraira ko Aap ne apni jootiyan de kar bheja tha ke jo shakhs milay aur wo gawahi deta ho la ilaah illa Allah ki dil se yaqeen rakh kar to usay jannat ki khushkhabri do Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya haan Umar raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke (Aap par mere maan baap qurban hun) aisa na kijiye kyunke mein darta hun ke log us par takiya kar baithein ge un ko amal karnay dijiye Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya acha un ko amal karnay do"
"13","[AI-translation] ´Muaz bin Jabal raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` mein sawaari par Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke hamraah peechay baitha hua tha mere aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke darmiyan siwae paalaan ki pichli lakri ke kuch na tha Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya Ae Muaz bin Jabal ! mein ne arz kiya ke mein haazir hun Aap ki khidmat mein aur Aap ka farmanbardaar hun Ae Allah ke Rasool ! phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam thori dair chalay us ke baad farmaya ke Ae Muaz bin Jabal ! mein ne kaha Ae Allah ke Rasool ! farmanbardaar Aap ki khidmat mein haazir hai phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam thori dair chalay us ke baad farmaya ke Ae Muaz bin Jabal ! mein ne kaha Ae Allah ke Rasool ! farmanbardaar Aap ki khidmat mein haazir hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke to janta hai Allah ka haq bandon par kiya hai mein ne kaha ke Allah aur us ka Rasoolullah khoob janta hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Allah ka haq bandon par ye hai ke usi ki ibadat karein aur us ke saath kisi ko shareek na karein phir Aap thori dair chalay phir farmaya ke Ae Muaz bin Jabal ! mein ne kaha Ae Allah ke Rasool ! mein Aap ki khidmat mein haazir hun aur Aap ka farmanbardaar hun Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke to janta hai ke jab banday ye kaam karein to un ka Allah par kiya haq hai jab banday ye kaam karein (yani usi ki ibadat karein kisi ko us ke saath shareek na karein) mein ne kaha ke Allah aur us ka Rasoolullah khoob janta hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke wo haq ye hai ke Allah un ko azaab na karay"
"14","[AI-translation] ´Mehmood bin Rubayyi raziyallahu anhu Utbaan bin Maalik raziyallahu anhu se riwayat kartay hue kehtay hain ke` mein Madina mein aaya to Utbaan se mila aur mein ne kaha ke aik hadees hai jo mujhe tum se pahunchi hai (pas tum usay bayan karo) Utbaan ne kaha ke meri nigaah mein fatoor ho gaya (doosri riwayat mein hai ke wo nabina ho gaye aur shayad zuaf basaarat muraad ho) mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas kehla bheja ke mein chahta hun ke Aap mere makaan par tashreef la kar kisi jagah namaz padhein taake mein us jagah ko musalla bana lun (yani hamesha wahein namaz padha karun aur ye darkhwast us liye ki ke aankh mein fatoor ho janay ki wajah se Masjid-e-Nabawi mein aana dushwaar tha) to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam tashreef laaye aur jin ko Allah ne chaha apne ashaab mein se saath laaye Aap andar aaye aur namaz padhnay lagay aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke ashaab aapas mein baatein kar rahay thay (munafiqon ka zikr chhir gaya to un ka haal bayan karnay lagay aur un ki buri baatein aur buri aadatein zikr karnay lagay) phir unhon ne bara munafiq Maalik bin Dakhsham ko kaha (ya Maalik bin Dukhaisham ya Maalik bin Dukhshan ya Dukhaishan) aur chaha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam us ke liye baddua karein aur wo mar jaye aur us par koi aafat aaye (to maloom hua ke badkaaron ke tabah honay ki aarzu karna bura nahi) itnay mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam namaz se farigh hue aur farmaya ke kiya wo (yani Maalik bin Dakhsham) us baat ki gawahi nahi deta ke Allah ke siwa koi sacha mabood nahi aur mein Allah ka Rasool hun sahaba ne arz kiya wo to us baat ko zubaan se kehta hai lekin dil mein us ka yaqeen nahi rakhta Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya jo sache dil se la ilaah illa Allah ki gawahi de aur Muhammad Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki phir wo jahannam mein na jaye ga ya us ko angaray na khayein ge Anas (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ye hadees mujhe bohat achi maloom hui to mein ne apne betay se kaha ke us ko likh le pas us ne likh liya"
"15","[AI-translation] ´Abu Sa'eed Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` kuch log Abdul Qais (qabeela Abdul Qais) ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaye aur kehnay lagay ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! ham Rabia ki aik shaakh hain aur hamaray aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke baich mein qabeela Muzar ke kafir hain aur ham Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas haraam maheenon ke ilawa (kisi aur maheena mein) nahi aa saktay to hamein aisay kaam ka hukm kijiye ke jisay ham un logon ko batlayein jo hamaray peechay (reh gaye) hain aur ham us kaam ki wajah se jannat mein jayein jab ke ham us par amal karein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mein tumhein chaar cheezon ka hukm karta hun aur chaar cheezon se mana karta hun (jin chaar cheezon ka hukm karta hun wo ye hain ke) sirf Allah ki ibadat karo aur us ke saath kisi ko shareek na karo aur namaz qaim karo aur zakaat do aur Ramazan ke rozay rakho aur ghaneemat ke maalon mein se paanchwaan hissa ada karo aur mein tumhein chaar cheezon se mana karta hun kaddu ke toombay aur sabz laakhi bartan aur roghni bartan aur naqeer se logon ne kaha Ae Allah ke Rasool ! naqeer Aap nahi jantay Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya kyun nahi janta naqeer aik lakri hai jisay tum khod letay ho phir us mein qat'ea (aik qasam ki choti khajoor us ko shareer bhi kehtay hain) bhigotay ho Sa'eed ne kaha ya ” tamar “ bhigotay ho phir us mein pani daaltay ho jab us ka josh tham jata hai to us ko peetay ho yahan tak ke tum mein se aik apne chacha ke betay ko talwaar se maarta hai (nasha mein aa kar jab aqal jati rehti hai to dost dushman ki shinaakht nahi rehti apne bhai ko jis ko sab se zyada chahta hai talwaar se maarta hai sharaab ki burayion mein se ye aik bari burayi hai jisay Aap ne bayan kiya) rawi ne kaha ke hamaray logon mein us waqt aik shakhs maujood tha (jis ka naam Jahm tha) us ko usi nasha ki wajah se aik zakhm lag chuka tha us ne kaha lekin mein us ko Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se sharam ke maaray chhupata tha mein ne kaha Ae Allah ke Rasool ! phir kis bartan mein ham bartan peyein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke chamray ki mashkon mein piyo jin ka munh (dori ya tasmay se) baandha jata hai logon ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! hamaray mulk mein choohay bohat hain wahan chamray ke bartan nahi reh saktay to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya chamray ke bartanon mein piyo agarchay choohay un ko kaat daalein agarchay un ko choohay kaat daalein agarchay un ko choohay kaat daalein (yani jis taur se ho sakay chamray hi ke bartan mein piyo choohon se hifazat karo lekin un bartanon mein pina durust nahi kyunke wo sharaab ke bartan hain) rawi ne kaha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Abdul Qais ke Ashajj se farmaya ke tujh mein do khaslatein aisi hain jin ko Allah Taala pasand karta hai aik to aqalmandi aur doosri sahoolat aur itminaan (yani jaldi na karna)"
"16","[AI-translation] ´Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se poocha ke kaun sa amal afzal hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Allah par iman lana aur us ki raah mein jihad karna mein ne kaha kaun sa banda azaad karna afzal hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke jo banda us ke Maalik ko umda maloom ho aur jis ki qeemat bhaari ho mein ne kaha ke agar mein ye na kar sakun Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke to kisi saane ki madad kar ya kisi be hunar shakhs ke liye mazdoori kar (yani jo koi kaam aur paisha na janta ho aur roti ka mohtaaj ho) mein ne kaha agar mein khud naatawan hun (yani kaam na kar sakun ya koi kasb na kar sakun) Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke to kisi se burayi na kar yehi tera apne nafs par sadqa hai"
"17","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke log tum se ilm ki baatein poochtay rahein ge yahan tak ke ye kahein ge Allah ne to hamein paida kiya phir Allah ko kis ne paida kiya rawi ne kaha ke Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) us hadees ko bayan kartay waqt aik shakhs ka haath pakare hue thay unhon ne kaha sach kaha Allah aur us ke Rasoolullah ne mujh se do aadmi yehi pooch chukay aur ye teesra hai ya yun kaha ke aik aadmi pooch chuka hai aur ye doosra hai"
"18","[AI-translation] ´Sufyan bin Abdullah as-Saqafi raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke` mein ne kaha Ae Allah ke Rasool ! mujhe Islam mein aik aisi baat bata dijiye ke phir mein us ko Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke baad (aur Abu Usaama ki riwayat mein hai ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke siwa) kisi se na poochon Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke keh mein Allah par iman laya phir us par qaim reh"
"19","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke har aik paighambar ko wohi mu'jizay milay hain jo us se pehle doosray paighambar ko mil chukay thay phir iman laaye us par aadmi lekin mujhe jo muajiza mila wo Quran hai jo Allah ne mere paas bheja (aisa muajiza kisi paighambar ko nahi mila) us liye mein umeed karta hun ke meri pairwi karnay walay qayamat ke din sab se zyada hun ge"
"20","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki jaan hai (mere us zamana se qayamat tak) koi Yahudi ya Nasraani (ya aur koi deen wala) mera haal sunay phir us par iman na laaye jo ke mein de kar bheja gaya hun (yani Quran o sunnat par) to wo jahannam mein jaye ga"
"21","[AI-translation] ´naik bin naik al-Hamdaani Sha'bi se riwayat kartay hain kehtay hain ke` mein ne aik shakhs ko dekha jo ke Khuraasaan ka rehnay wala tha us ne Sha'bi se poocha ke hamaray mulk ke log kehtay hain ke jo shakhs apni londi ko azaad kar ke phir us se nikah kar le to us ki misaal aisi hai jaisay koi qurbani ke janwar par sawaari karay Sha'bi ne kaha ke mujh se Burda bin Abu Musa ne bayan kiya unhon ne apne walid se ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ” teen qasam ke aadmiyon ko dohra sawab milay ga ” aik to wo shakhs jo ahl kitab mein se ho “ (yani Yahudi ya Nasraani) apne paighambar par iman laya ho aur phir mera zamana paye aur mujh par bhi iman laaye meri pairwi karay aur mujhe sacha janay ga to us ko dohra sawab hai aur aik us ghulam ko jo Allah ka haq ada karay aur apne Maalik ka bhi us ko dohra sawab hai aur aik us shakhs ko jis ke paas aik londi ho phir achi tarah us ko khulaye aur pulaye us ke baad achi tarah taleem o tarbiyat karay phir us ko azaad kar ke us se nikah kar le to us ko bhi dohra sawab hai phir Sha'bi ne Khuraasaani se kaha ke to ye hadees baghair mehnat kiye le le nahi to aik shakhs us se choti hadees ke liye muddinay tak safar kiya karta tha"
"22","[AI-translation] ´Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : teen baatein jis mein hun gi wo un ki wajah se iman ki mithaas aur halaawat paye ga aik to ye ke Allah aur us ke Rasoolullah se doosray sab logon se zyada mohabbat rakhay doosray ye ke kisi aadmi se sirf Allah ke wastay Dausti rakhay (yani duniya ki koi gharz na ho aur na hi us se darr ho) teesray ye ke kufr mein lautnay ko baad us ke ke Allah ne us se bacha liya us tarah bura janay jaisay aag mein daal diya jana"
"23","[AI-translation] ´Anas (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : tum mein se koi banda us waqt tak momin nahi ho sakta jab tak ke us ko meri mohabbat aulad maan baap aur sab logon se zyada na ho"
"24","[AI-translation] ´Anas (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya mujhe qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai ke koi aadmi momin nahi ho sakta jab tak ke apne ya hamsaya bhai ke liye wohi na chahay jo wo apne liye chahta hai"
"25","[AI-translation] ´Abbas bin Muttalib raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke` unhon ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke us ne iman ka maza chakh liya jo Allah ke Rab aalim (laiq ibadat) honay Islam ke deen honay aur Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paighambar honay par raazi ho gaya"
"26","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Amr (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : chaar baatein jis mein hun gi wo to khaalis munafiq hai aur jis mein un chaaron mein se aik khaslat ho gi to us mein nifaaq ki aik hi aadat hai yahan tak ke us ko chhor de aik to ye ke jab baat karay to jhoot bolay doosri ye ke jab mu'aahida karay to us ke khilaf karay teesri ye ke jab waada karay to poora na karay chauthi ye ke jab jhagra karay to badkalaami karay ya gaali gilaunch karay aur Sufyan ki riwayat mein ” khulla “ ki jagah ” khaslat “ ka lafz hai"
"27","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : munafiq ki teen nishaniaan hain jab baat karay to jhooti baat karay jab waada karay to waada ke khilaf karay aur jab usay amanat saunpi jaye to us mein khayanat karay"
"28","[AI-translation] ´Ka'b bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : momin ki misaal aisi hai jaisay khait ka narm jhaar ho hua us ko jhonkay deti hai kabhi us ko gira deti hai aur kabhi seedha kar deti hai yahan tak ke sookh jata hai aur kafir ki misaal aisi hai jaisay sanaubar ka darakht jo apni jar par seedha khara rehta hai us ko koi cheez nahi jhukati yahan tak kaha yak baargi ukhar jata hai aik riwayat mein hai ke momin ki misaal us khaiti ki tarah hai jis ko hua kabhi gira deti hai aur kabhi seedha khara kar deti hai hatta ke wo pak kar tayyar ho aur munafiq ki misaal us sanaubar ke darakht ki tarah hai seedha khara ho aur us ko koi cheez na pahunche"
"29","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai bayan kartay hain ke` ham Rasool-e-Akram sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas baithay hue thay ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mujhe us darakht ke mutaliq batao jo momin (Muslim) ke mushaabeh hai ya Musalman aadmi ki tarah hai (us ki nishani ye hai ke) us ke pattay nahi girtay phal har waqt deta hai Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke mere dil mein khayal paida hua ke ye khajoor ka darakht hai aur mein ne dekha ke Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) aur Umar raziyallahu anhu koi baat nahi kar rahay to mein ne baat karna ya kuch kehna acha khayal na kiya (baad mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne khajoor ka darakht bataya aur Abdullah bin Umar raziyallahu anhuma ne Umar raziyallahu anhu se zikr kiya) to Umar raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke agar to us waqt bol deta to mujhe aisi cheezon se zyada pasand tha (yani mujhe bohat khushi hoti)"
"30","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke iman ki satr par kai ya saath par kai shaakhein hain un sab mein afzal la ilaah illa Allah kehna hai aur un sab mein adna raah mein se moozi cheez ka hatana hai aur haya iman ki aik shaakh hai"
"31","[AI-translation] ´Abu Qatada (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` ham Imran bin Husain (raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aik reht (das se kam mardon ki jamaat ko reht kehtay hain) mein thay aur ham mein Bashir bin Ka'b bhi thay Imran raziyallahu anhu ne us din hadees bayan ki ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke haya khair hai bilkul ya haya bilkul khair hai Bashir bin Ka'b ne kaha ke ham ne baaz kitabon mein ya hikmat mein dekha hai ke haya ki aik qasam to sakeena aur waqaar hai Allah Taala ke liye aur aik haya zuaf nafs hai ye sun kar Imran raziyallahu anhu ko itna ghussa aaya ke un ki aankhein surkh ho gayein aur unhon ne kaha ke mein to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki hadees bayan karta hun aur to us ke khilaf bayan karta hai Abu Qatada ne kaha ke Imran raziyallahu anhu ne phir dobara usi hadees ko bayan kiya Bashir ne phir dobara wohi baat kahi to Imran ghussa hue (aur unhon ne Bashir ko saza denay ka qasd kiya) to ham sab ne kaha ke Ae Abu Nujaid ! (ye Imran bin Husain (raziyallahu anhu) ki kunniyat hai) Bashir ham mein se hai (yani Musalman hai) us mein koi aib nahi (yani wo munafiq ya bedeen ya bidati nahi hai jaisay tum ne khayal kiya)"
"32","[AI-translation] ´Abu Shuraih al-Khuzaai raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke` Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jo shakhs Allah par aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho wo apne hamsaya ke saath neki karay aur jo shakhs Allah par aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho wo apne mehmaan ke saath ehsaan karay aur jo shakhs Allah par aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho wo achi baat kahay (jis mein bhalayi ho ya sawab ho) ya chup rahay"
"33","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke wo shakhs jannat mein na jaye ga jis ka hamsaya us ke makr fasaad se mehfooz nahi hai"
"34","[AI-translation] ´Taariq bin Shihab kehtay hain ke` sab se pehle jis ne Eid ke din namaz se pehle khutba shuru kiya wo Marwan tha (hukm ka beta jo khulafa Bani Umayya mein se pehla khaleefa hai) us waqt aik shakhs khara hua aur kehnay laga ke namaz khutba se pehle hai Marwan ne kaha ke ye baat mauqoof kar di gayi Abu Sa'eed (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke us shakhs ne to apna farz ada kar diya mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke jo shakhs tum mein se kisi munkar (khilaf shara) kaam ko dekhay to us ko apne haath se mita de agar itni taqat na ho to zubaan se aur agar itni bhi taqat na ho to dil hi se sahi (dil mein us ko bura janay aur us se bezaar ho) ye iman ka sab se kam darja hai"
"35","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Allah Taala ne mujh se pehle koi Nabi aisa nahi bheja ke jis ke us ki ummat mein se hawaari aur ashaab na hun jo us ke tareeqay par chaltay thay aur us ke hukm ki pairwi kartay thay phir un logon ke baad aisay naalaayiq log paida hotay hain jo zubaan se kehtay hain aur kartay nahi aur un kaamon ko kartay hain jin ka hukm nahi diye jatay phir jo koi un naalaayiqon se haath se laray wo momin aur jo koi zubaan se laray (un ko bura kahay aur un ki baaton ka radd karay) wo bhi momin hai aur jo koi un se dil se laray (dil mein un ko bura janay) wo bhi momin hai aur us ke baad daanay barabar bhi iman nahi (yani agar dil se bhi bura na janay to us mein zarra barabar bhi iman nahi) Abu Raafe raziyallahu anhu (jinhon ne us hadees ko Ibn Masud (raziyallahu anhuma) se bayan kiya wo Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke maula thay) ne kaha ke mein ne ye hadees Abdullah bin Umar raziyallahu anhuma se bayan ki unhon ne na maana aur inkar kiya ittifaaq se mere paas Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) aaye aur Qanaat (Madina ki waadion mein se aik waadi ka naam hai) mein utray to Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) mujhe Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) ki iyadat ke liye apne saath le gaye mein un ke saath gaya jab ham baithay to mein ne Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) se us hadees ke baaray mein poocha to unhon ne usi tarah bayan kiya jaisay mein ne Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se bayan kiya tha"
"36","[AI-translation] ´Zirr bin Hubaish raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` Ali bin Abu Talib (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke qasam hai us ki jis ne gandum cheera (phir us se ghaas ugayi) aur jaan banayi Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mujh se ehad kiya tha ke mujh se siwae momin ke koi mohabbat nahi rakhay ga aur mujh se munafiq ke ilawa aur koi shakhs dushmani nahi rakhay ga"
"37","[AI-translation] ´Bara (raziyallahu anhu) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Ansaar ke baaray mein farmaya ke un ka dost momin hai aur un ka dushman munafiq hai aur jis ne un se mohabbat ki Allah Taala us se mohabbat karay ga aur jis ne un se dushmani ki Allah Taala us se dushmani karay ga"
"38","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : iman us tarah simat kar Madina mein aa jaye ga jaisay saanp simat kar apne bal mein sama jata hai"
"39","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai kehtay hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko ye farmatay hue suna ke Yaman ke log (khud Musalman honay ko) aaye aur wo log narm dil hain aur narm khu hain iman Yaman ka hi acha hai aur hikmat bhi Yaman hi ki (behtar) hai aur ghareebi aur itminaan bakriyon walon mein hai aur barayi o shaikhi maarna aur fakhr o ghumand karna ghoray walon aur oont walon mein hai jo chalatay hain aur wabar walay hain sooraj ke tuloo honay ki taraf se"
"40","[AI-translation] ´Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke dilon ki sakhti aur kharkhara pan mashriq (poorab) walon mein hai aur iman Hijaaz walon mein"
"41","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` mein ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Jad'aan ka beta jahiliyat ke door mein naatay jorta tha (yani rishta daaron ke saath acha sulook karta tha) aur miskeenon ko khana khulata tha kiya ye kaam us ko (qayamat ke din) faida dein ge Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke usay ye aamaal kuch faida na dein ge kyunke us ne kabhi yun na kaha ke Ae mere Rab mere gunaahon ko qayamat ke din bakhsh de"
"42","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tum jannat mein na jao ge jab tak ke iman na lao ge aur imandaar na Banu ge aur jab tak aik doosray se mohabbat na rakho ge aur mein tum ko wo cheez na batla dun ke jab tum us ko karo ge to aapas mein mohabbat ho jaye (pas us ke liye tum) salam ko aapas mein raayij karo"
"43","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : zina karnay wala zina nahi karta magar ye ke ain zina kartay waqt wo momin nahi rehta aur na hi chor ain chori kartay waqt momin rehta hai aur na sharaab peenay wala ain sharaab peetay waqt momin rehta hai aur Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) us mein itna aur mila detay thay ke na lautnay wala shakhs aisi laut jo bari cheez ho (yani haqeer cheez na ho) jis ki taraf logon ki nazar uthay to wo bhi ain laut-tay waqt momin nahi hota aur Hammaam ki riwayat mein ((yarfa ilaih al-muminoon a'yunahum)) ki jagah ((wa huwa heena yantahibuha mumin)) ke alfaaz hain aur aik riwayat mein hai ke khayanat kartay waqt (bhi banda) momin nahi hota"
"44","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke momin ko aik suraakh se do baar dang nahi lagta (dasa nahi jata yani momin jab kisi muamla mein aik baar khata uthaye to dobara us ko na karay)"
"45","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` sahaba mein se kuch log Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaye aur poocha ke hamaray dilon mein wo wo khayal guzartay hain ke jin ka bayan karna ham mein se har aik ko bara gunah maloom hota hai (yani us khayal ko keh nahi saktay kyunke maazAllah wo khayal kufr ya fisq ka khayal hota hai jis ka munh se nikalna mushkil maloom hota hai) Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke kiya tum ko aisay waswasay hotay hain logon ne kaha ji haan Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke ye to ain iman hai"
"46","[AI-translation] ´Abdur Rahman bin Abu Bakr apne walid (Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu)) se riwayat kartay hain ke` unhon ne kaha ke ham Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas thay Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke kiya mein tum ko bara kabeera gunah na batlaun teen baar Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne yehi farmaya (phir farmaya ke) Allah ke saath shirk karna (ye to zaahir hai ke sab se bara kabeera gunah hai) doosray apne maan baap ki nafarmani karna teesray jhooti gawahi dena ya jhoot bolna aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam takiya lagao baithay thay Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam uth kar baith gaye aur baar ye farmanay lagay (taake log khoob aagaah ho jayein aur un kaamon se baaz rahein) hatta ke ham ne apne dil mein kaha ke Kaash Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam khamosh ho jayein (taake Aap ko zyada ranj na ho un gunaahon ka khayal kar ke ke log un ko kiya kartay hain)"
"47","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke saat gunaahon se bacho jo iman ko halaak kar daaltay hain sahaba ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! wo kaun se gunah hain Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : 1 Allah ke saath shirk karna 2 aur jadu karna 3 aur us jaan ko maarna jis ka maarna Allah Taala ne haraam kiya hai lekin haq par maarna durust hai 4 aur sood khana 5 aur yateem ka maal kha jana 6 aur larai ke din kafiron ke saamnay se bhaagna 7 aur shaadi shuda imandaar paak daaman auraton ko jo badkaari se waaqif nahi aib lagana"
"48","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Hajjat al-Wida mein farmaya ke mere baad kafir mat ho jana ke aik doosray ki gardanein maarnay (qatl karnay) lago"
"49","[AI-translation] ´Usman se riwayat hai ke` jab Ziyad ka daawa kiya gaya to mein Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) se (Ziyad un ka maadri bhai tha) aur mein ne kaha ke tum (yani tumharay bhai) ne kiya kiya beshak mein ne Sa'd bin Abu Waqqas (raziyallahu anhu) se suna wo kehtay thay ke mere kaanon ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke jis ne Islam qabool karnay ke baad apne baap ke siwa aur kisi ko baap banaya to us par jannat haraam hai Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke mein ne bhi khud Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se yehi suna hai"
"50","[AI-translation] ´Abu Zarr Ghaffari raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke` unhon ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko ye farmatay hue suna ke jo shakhs apne Aap ko kisi aur ka beta kahay aur wo janta ho ke wo us ka beta nahi hai (yani jaan bojh kar apne baap ke siwa kisi aur ko baap batlaye) wo kafir ho gaya aur jis shakhs ne us cheez ka daawa kiya jo us ki nahi hai to wo ham mein se nahi hai aur wo apna thikana jahannam mein bana le aur jo shakhs kisi ko kafir keh kar bulaaway ya Allah Taala ka dushman keh kar phir wo shakhs ke jisay us naam se pukara gaya hai aisa (yani kafir) na ho to wo kufr pukaarnay walay par palat aaye ga"
"51","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai kehtay hain ke` aik shakhs ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Allah ke qareeb bara gunah kaun sa hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : ye ke to kisi ko Allah Taala ka shareek karay halanke tujhe Allah (hi) ne paida kiya us ne kaha phir kaun sa (gunah bara hai) Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : ye ke to apni aulad ko us darr se qatl karay ke wo tere saath khaye gi us ne kaha phir kaun sa (gunah bara hai) Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : ye ke to apne hamsaya ki aurat se zina karay phir Allah Taala ne us hadees ki tasdeeq mein ye aayat naazil farmayi ke ” aur Allah ke saath kisi doosray mabood ko nahi pukaartay aur kisi aisay shakhs ko jisay qatl karna Allah Taala ne mana kar diya ho wo bajuz haq ke qatl nahi kartay na wo zina ke qareeb jatay hain aur jo koi ye kaam karay wo apne upar sakht wabaal laaye ga “ (Surah : Furqan : 68)"
"52","[AI-translation] ´Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` aik shakhs ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se poocha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! do wajib kar denay wali cheezein kiya kiya hain Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jis ko us haal mein maut aaye ke wo Allah ke saath kisi ko shareek na karta ho wo jannat mein jaye ga aur jis ko us haal mein maut aaye ke Allah ke saath kisi ko shareek karta ho wo jahannam mein daakhil ho ga"
"53","[AI-translation] ´Abu Aswad ad-Daili se riwayat hai ke` Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) ne un se ye bayan kiya ke mein Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaya aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam safed kapray orhay hue sau rahay thay (mein wapas laut gaya) jab dobara aaya to bhi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam sauye hue thay jab teesri baar aaya to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jaag chukay thay to mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas baith gaya Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke jo shakhs la ilaah illa Allah kahay (yani Allah ki tauheed ka aqeeda rakhay aur phir usi par) wo faut ho jaye to jannat mein jaye ga mein ne kaha Ae Allah ke Rasool ! agarchay us se chori aur zina bhi ho jaye phir bhi to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ” haan agarchay us se zina aur chori bhi ho jaye “ Chunanche mein ne teen baar Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se yehi sawal kiya aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne teenon martaba yehi jawab diya aur chauthi martaba farmaya ” haan wo jannat mein daakhil ho ga agarchay Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) ki naak mitti mein mil jaye “ phir Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) ye kehtay hue niklay ke agarchay Zarr ki naak khaak aalood ho"
"54","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : wo shakhs jannat mein na jaye ga jis ke dil mein ratti barabar bhi ghuroor aur ghumand ho ga aik shakhs bola ke har aik aadmi chahta hai ke us ka kapra acha ho aur us ka joota (auron se) acha ho (to kiya ye bhi ghuroor aur ghumand hai) Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Allah Taala khoobsurat hai aur khoobsurati pasand karta hai ghuroor aur ghumand ye hai ke insaan haq ko naahaq karay (yani apni baat ki pach ya nafssaniyat se aik baat wajibi aur sahih ho to us ko radd karay aur na manay) aur logon ko haqeer samjhay"
"55","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : logon mein do baatein maujood hain aur wo donon kufr hain aik nasab mein taan karna aur doosra mayyat par chala kar rona (us ke ausaf bayan karna jisay nauha karna kehtay hain)"
"56","[AI-translation] ´Zaid bin Khalid Juhani (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne hamein subah ki namaz Hudaibiya mein (jo Makka ke qareeb aik muqaam ka naam hai) padhayi aur raat ko barish hui thi jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam namaz se farigh hue to logon ki taraf mutawajjah ho kar farmaya ke tum jantay ho ke tumharay Rab ne kiya farmaya unhon ne kaha ke Allah aur us ka Rasoolullah khoob janta hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Allah Taala ne ye farmaya ke mere bandon mein se baazon ki subah to iman par hui aur baazon ki kufr par to jis ne ye kaha ke barish Allah Taala ke fazl aur us ki rehmat se hui to wo taaron ke barish barasanay ka munkar hua aur mujh par iman laya aur jis ne kaha ke barish taaron ki gardish ki wajah se hui to us ne mere saath kufr kiya aur taaron par iman laya"
"57","[AI-translation] ´Sha'bi se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Jarir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) ko ye kehtay hue suna ke` jo ghulam apne Maalik se bhaag jaye to wo kafir ho gaya (yahan kufr se muraad naashukri hai kyunke us ne Maalik ka haq ada na kiya) jab tak laut kar un ke paas na aaye Mansoor ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam ye hadees to marfooan Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se marwi hai lekin (mein ne yahan marfooan bayan nahi ki balke Jarir ka qaul bataya) mujhe bura maloom hota hai ke ye hadees mujh se us jagah Basra mein bayan ki jaye"
"58","[AI-translation] ´Jarir raziyallahu anhu Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jab ghulam (apne Maalik ke paas se) bhaag jaye to us ki namaz qabool na ho gi"
"59","[AI-translation] ´Amr bin Aas raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam chupkay se nahi balke pukaar kar farmatay thay ke falan ki aulad meri azeez nahi balke mera Maalik yani dost Allah hai aur mere azeez wo momin hain jo naik hun"
"60","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Allah Taala kisi momin par aik neki ke liye bhi zulm na karay ga us ka badla duniya mein de ga aur aakhirat mein bhi de ga aur kafir ko us ki naikiyon ka badla duniya mein diya jata hai yahan tak ke jab aakhirat ho gi to us ke paas koi neki na rahay gi jis ka ke usay badla diya jaye"
"61","[AI-translation] ´Talha bin Ubaidullah raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke` Najd walon (Najd Arab mein aik ilaaqa hai) mein se aik shakhs Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaya jis ke baal bikhray hue thay aur us ki aawaz ki gungunahat suni jati thi lekin samajh mein na aata tha ke kiya kehta hai yahan tak ke wo Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke qareeb aaya tab maloom hua ke wo Islam ke baaray mein poochta hai Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke din raat mein paanch namazein farz hain wo bola ke un ke siwa mere upar koi aur namaz (farz) hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke nahi magar ye ke to nafl padhna chahay aur Ramazan ke rozay hain wo bola ke mujh par Ramazan ke siwa aur koi rozah (farz) hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke nahi magar ye ke to nafl rozah rakhna chahay phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us se zakaat ka bayan kiya to wo bola ke mujh par us ke siwa aur koi zakaat (farz) hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke nahi magar ye ke to nafl sawab ke liye sadqa dena chahay rawi ne kaha ke phir wo shakhs peeth mor kar chala aur kehta jata tha ke Allah ki qasam mein na un se zyada karun ga aur na un mein kami karun ka Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke agar ye apne us (baat ke) kehnay mein sacha hai to beshak ye kaamyaab ho gaya aik doosri riwayat mein hai ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke qasam us ke baap ki ke agar ye sacha hai to us ne nijaat paayi ya (ye farmaya ke) us ke baap ki qasam ! agar ye (apni baat ke kehnay mein) sacha hai to ye jannat mein daakhil ho ga"
"62","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Islam ki bunyaad paanch cheezon par rakhi gayi hai hai (ye tashbeeh hai ke Islam ko aik ghar ki manind samjho ya aik chhat ki manind ke jis mein paanch sutoon hun) Allah Jal Jalaluhu ki tauheed (wahdaaniyat ki gawahi dena) namaz ko qaim karna zakaat dena Ramazan ke rozay rakhna aur Hajj karna aik shakhs bola ke Hajj aur Ramazan ke rozay rakhna (yani Hajj ko pehle kiya aur rozon ko baad) Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha Ramazan ke rozay aur Hajj mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se yun hi suna hai"
"63","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Amr (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke` aik shakhs ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se poocha ke kaun sa Islam behtar hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : ye ke to (bhooke shakhs aur mehmaan ko) khana khulaye aur har shakhs ko salam karay khwah to us ko pehchaanta ho ya na pehchanta ho"
"64","[AI-translation] ´Abdur Rahman bin Shamaasa al-Mahri kehtay hain ke` ham Amr bin Aas raziyallahu anhu ke paas gaye aur wo us waqt qareeb ul marg thay to wo (Amr raziyallahu anhu) bohat dair tak roye aur apna munh deewar ki taraf pher liya to un ke betay kehnay lagay ke Ae hamaray walid ! Aap kyun rotay hain kiya Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Aap ko ye khushkhabri nahi di ye khushkhabri nahi di tab unhon ne apna munh saamnay kiya aur kaha ke sab baaton mein afzal ham us baat ki gawahi denay ko samajhtay hain ke Allah Taala ke siwa koi sacha mabood nahi aur Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam us ke bhejay hue hain aur mere upar teen haal guzray hain aik haal ye tha ke jo mein ne apne Aap ko dekha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se zyada mein kisi ko bura nahi janta tha aur mujhe aarzu thi ke kisi tarah mein qaabu paon aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko (maazAllah) qatl kar dun phir agar mein usi haal mein mar jata to jahannami hota doosra haal ye tha ke Allah Taala ne mere dil mein Islam ki mohabbat daali aur mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaya aur mein ne kaha ke apna daahna haath barhayie taake mein Aap se (Islam par) bai'at karun Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apna haath barhaya to mein ne us waqt apna haath kheench liya Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ae Amr ! tujhe kiya hua mein ne kaha ke mein aik shart karna chahta hun Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke kaun si shart mein ne kaha ke ye shart ke mere tamam gunah maaf ho jayein ge (jo mein ne ab tak kiye hain) Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ae Amr ! to nahi janta hai Islam pehle tamam gunaahon ko gira deta hai aur usi tarah hijrat pehle gunaahon ko gira deti hai usi tarah Hajj tamam paishtar gunaahon ko gira deta hai phir mujhe Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se zyada kisi se mohabbat na thi aur na meri nigaah mein Aap se zyada kisi ki shaan thi aur mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke jalaal ki wajah se Aap ko aankh bhar kar na dekh sakta tha aur agar koi mujh se Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki soorat ke baaray mein poochay to mein bayan nahi kar sakta kyunke mein aankh bhar kar Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko nahi dekh sakta tha aur agar mein us haal mein mar jata to umeed thi ke jinti hota us ke baad chand aur cheezon mein hamein phansna para mein nahi janta ke un ki wajah se mera kiya haal ho ga to jab mein mar jaun to mere janazay ke saath koi ronay chalanay wali na ho aur na aag ho aur jab mujhe dafan karna to mujh par achi tarah mitti daal dena aur meri qabr ke ird gird itni dair tak kharay rehna jitni dair mein oont kaata jata hai aur us ka gosht baanta jata hai taake tum se mera dil behlay (aur mein tanhayi mein ghabra na jaun) aur dekh lun ke mein Rab ke wakeelon (farishton) ko kiya jawab deta hun"
"65","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Musalman ko gaali dena (ya us ka aib bayan karna) fisq hai (yani gunah hai aur aisa karnay wala faasiq ho jata hai) aur us se larna kufr hai"
"66","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke logon ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se kaha ke` Ae Allah ke Rasool ! kiya ham se un kaamon ki bhi pooch guchh ho gi jo ham ne jahiliyat ke zamanay mein kiye hain Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tum mein se jo achi tarah Islam laya (yani dil se sacha Musalman hua) us se to jahiliyat ke kaamon ka muakhaza na ga aur jo bura hai (yani sirf zaahir mein Musalman hua aur us ke dil mein kufr raha) to us se jahiliyat aur Islam ke kaamon donon ke baaray mein muakhaza ho ga"
"67","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Allah Azza wa Jal ne farmaya ke jab mera banda dil mein naik kaam karnay ki niyyat karta hai to mein us ke liye aik neki likh leta hun jab tak ke us ne wo neki nahi ki phir agar wo neki ki to us ko mein us ke liye das neki (aik ke badlay) likhta hun aur jab dil mein burayi karnay ki niyyat karta hai to mein us ko bakhsh deta hun jab tak ke wo burayi (par amal) na karay aur phir jab wo burayi (par amal) karay to us ke liye aik hi burayi likhta hun aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke farishtay kehtay hain ke Ae Rab ye tera banda hai burayi karna chahta hai halanke Allah Taala un se zyada apne banday ko dekh raha hai Allah Taala farmata hai ke dekhtay raho ! agar wo burayi karay to aik burayi waisi hi likh lo aur agar na karay (aur us burayi ke iraaday se baaz rahay) to us ke liye aik neki likh lo kyunke us ne mere darr se us burayi ko chhor diya aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke jab tum mein se kisi ka Islam behtar hota hai (yani khaalis aur sacha nifaaq se khaali) to phir wo jo neki karta hai us ke liye aik ke badlay das neki saat sau guna tak likhi jati hain aur jo burayi karta hai to us ke liye aik hi burayi likhi jati hai yahan tak ke wo Allah Taala se mil jata hai"
"68","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Allah tabaarak o Taala ne meri ummat se (gunah ke) un khayaalaat se darguzar kiya jo dil mein aayein jab tak ke un ko zubaan se na nikaalein ya un par amal na karein"
"69","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Amr bin al-Aas raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke` aik shakhs ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se poocha ke kaun sa Musalman behtar hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke wo Musalman jis ki zubaan aur haath se Musalman bachay rahein (yani na zubaan se kisi Musalman ki burayi karay aur na haath se kisi ko eeza de)"
"70","[AI-translation] ´Urwa bin Zubair se riwayat hai aur unhein Hakeem bin Hizam (raziyallahu anhu) ne bataya ke` unhon (Hakeem) ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Aap kiya samajhtay hain ke jo naik kaam mein ne jahiliyat ke zamana mein kiye thay jaisay sadqa ya ghulam ka azaad karna ya naata milana un ka sawab mujhe milay ga Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke to usi neki par Islam laya hai jo ke pehle kar chuka hai (yani wo neki qaim hai ab us par Islam zyada hua)"
"71","[AI-translation] ´Huzaifa (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke ham Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath thay ` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke gino kitnay aadmi Islam ke qaayil hain phir ham ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! kiya Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ham par (dushmanon ki wajah se koi aafat aanay se) darrtay hain aur beshak ham chhe sau aadmiyon se le kar saat sau tak hain Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tum nahi jantay shayad museebat mein par jao Huzaifa (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke phir aisa hi hua ke ham museebat mein par gaye yahan tak ke baaz ham mein se namaz bhi chupkay se (chhup kar) padhtay"
"72","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Islam ghurbat mein shuru hua aur phir ghareeb ho jaye ga jaisay ke shuru hua tha aur wo simat kar donon masjidon (Makka Madina) ke darmiyan mein aa jaye ga jaisay ke saanp simat kar apne suraakh (bal) mein chala jata hai"
"73","[AI-translation] ´Urwa bin Zubair se riwayat hai aur unhein Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne khabar di ` unhon ne kaha ke pehle pehal jo wahi Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par shuru hui wo ye thi ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka khwab sacha honay laga Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jab koi khwab dekhtay to wo subah ki roshani ki tarah numoodaar hota phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko tanhayi ka shauq hua Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ghaar Hira mein akelay tashreef rakhtay kai kai raaton tak wahan ibadat kiya kartay aur ghar mein na aatay apna tosha saath le jatay phir Umm ul-Momineen Khadija raziyallahu anha ke paas laut kar aatay aur wo itna hi aur tosha tayyar kar detein yahan tak ke achanak Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par wahi naazil (aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko wahi ki tawaqqo na thi) Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam usi ghaar Hira mein thay ke farishta Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaya aur us ne kaha ke padho ! Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mein padha hua nahi (Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke) us farishtay ne mujhe pakar kar daboocha itna ke wo thak gaya ya mein thak gaya phir mujhe chhor diya aur kaha ke padh ! mein ne kaha ke mein padha hua nahi us ne phir mujhe pakra aur daboocha yahan tak ke thak gaya phir chhor diya aur kaha ke padh ! mein ne kaha mein padha hua nahi us ne phir mujhe pakra aur daboocha yahan tak ke thak gaya phir chhor diya aur kaha ke ” padh ! apne Rab ke naam se jis ne paida kiya jis ne insaan ko khoon ke lothray se paida kiya to padhta reh tera Rab baray karam wala hai jis ne qalam ke zariye (ilm) sikhaya jis ne insaan ko wo sikhaya jisay wo nahi janta tha “ ye sun kar Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam lautay aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke kandhay aur gardan ke baich ka gosht (darr aur khauf se) pharak raha tha (chunke ye wahi ka pehla marhala tha aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko aadat na thi us wastay haibat chha gayi) yahan tak ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Umm ul-Momineen Khadija raziyallahu anha ke paas pahunche aur farmaya ke mujhe (kapron se) dhaanp do dhaanp do unhon dhaanp diya yahan tak ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka darr jata raha us waqt Umm ul-Momineen Khadija raziyallahu anha se farmaya ke Ae Khadija mujhe kiya ho gaya aur sab haal bayan kiya aur kaha ke mujhe apni jaan ka khauf hai Umm ul-Momineen Khadija raziyallahu anha ne kaha hargiz nahi Aap khush rahein Allah ki qasam Allah Taala Aap ko kabhi ruswa na karay ga ya kabhi ranjeeda na karay ga Allah ki qasam Aap naatay ko jortay hain sach boltay hain aur bojh uthatay hain (yani ayaal aur atfaal aur yateem aur miskeen ke saath ta'aawun kartay hain un ka baar uthatay hain) aur naadaar ke liye kamayi kartay hain aur mehmaan ki khaatirdaari kartay hain aur sachi aafaton (jaisay koi qarz daar ya muflis ho gaya ya aur kisi tabahi) mein logon ki madad kartay hain phir Umm ul-Momineen Khadija raziyallahu anha Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko Waraqa bin Naufal ke paas le gayein aur wo Umm ul-Momineen Khadija raziyallahu anha ke chachazaad bhai thay (kyunke Waraqa Naufal ke betay thay aur Naufal Asad ke betay aur Umm ul-Momineen Khadija raziyallahu anha Khuwailid ki beti thin aur Khuwailid Asad ke betay thay to Waraqa aur Khadija ke baap bhai bhai thay) aur jahiliyat ke zamana mein wo Nasraani ho gaye thay aur Arabi likhna jantay thay to jitna Allah Taala ko manzoor hota Injeel ko Arabi zubaan mein likhtay thay aur bohat boorhay thay un ki bainayi (burhapay ki wajah se) jati rahi thi Umm ul-Momineen Khadija raziyallahu anha ne un se kaha ke Ae chacha ! (wo chacha ke betay thay lekin buzrugi ke liye un ko chacha kaha aur aik riwayat mein chacha ke betay hain) apne bhatijay ki suno Waraqa ne kaha ke Ae mere bhatijay ! tum ne kiya dekha Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne jo kuch kaifiyat dekhi thi sab bayan ki to Waraqa ne kaha ke ye to wo naamoos hai jo Musa alaihissalam par naazil thi (naamoos se muraad Jibrail alaihissalam hain) Kaash mein us zamana mein jawan hota Kaash mein us waqt tak zinda rehta jab tumhari qaum tumhein nikaal de gi Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke kiya wo mujhe nikaal dein ge Waraqa ne kaha haan ! jab koi shakhs duniya mein wo le kar aaya jisay tum laaye ho (yani shariat aur deen) to log us ke dushman ho gaye aur agar mein us din ko paon ga to achi tarah tumhari madad karun ga"
"74","[AI-translation] ´Yahya kehtay hain ke mein ne Salama se poocha ke` sab se pehle Quran mein se kiya utra unhon ne kaha ke ((ya ayyuhal al-Muddassir)) mein ne kaha ke ya ((iqra)) (sab se pehle naazil) unhon ne kaha ke mein ne Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) se poocha ke Quran mein sab se pehle kiya utra to unhon ne kaha ke ((ya ayyuhal al-Muddassir)) mein ne kaha ke ya ((iqra)) (sab se pehle naazil) Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke mein tum se wo hadees bayan karta hun jo Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ham se bayan ki thi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mein (ghaar) Hira mein aik maheena tak raha jab meri rehnay ki muddat poori ho gayi to mein utra aur waadi ke andar chala kisi ne mujhe aawaz di mein ne saamnay aur peechay aur daayein aur baayein dekha koi nazar na aaya phir mujhe kisi ne aawaz di mein ne dekha magar kisi ko na paya phir kisi ne mujhe aawaz di to mein ne sar upar utha kar dekha to wo hua mein aik takht par hain yani Jibrail alaihissalam mujhe ye dekh kar sakht (haibat ke maaray) larza charh aaya tab mein Khadija raziyallahu anha ke paas aaya aur mein ne kaha ke mujhe kapra orha do ! unhon ne kapra orha diya aur pani (haibat door karnay ke liye) mere upar daalnay tab Allah Taala ne ye aayaat utaarein ” Ae kapra orhnay walay khara ho ja aur aagaah kar de aur apne Rab hi ki barayiaan bayan kar aur apne kapron ko paak rakh ........ “ (Surah : al-Muddassir 1 , 4)"
"75","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` beshak Allah Azza wa Jal ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki wafaat se qabal pay darpay wahi utari hatta ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne wafaat paayi aur sab se zyada wahi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki wafaat ke din naazil hui"
"76","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : mere saamnay aik safed Buraaq laya gaya aur wo aik janwar hai safed rang ka lamba gadhay se ooncha aur khachar se chota apne sum wahan rakhta hai jahan tak us ki nigaah pahunchti hai (to aik lamha mein aasmaan tak ja sakta hai) farmaya : mein us par sawaar hua aur bait Bait-ul-Maqdis tak aaya farmaya : wahan mein ne us janwar ko us halqa se baandh diya jis se aur paighambar apne apne janwaron ko baandha kartay thay (ye halqa masjid ke darwazay par hai aur baandh denay se ye maloom hua ke insaan ko apni cheezon ki ehtiyaat aur hifazat zaroori hai aur ye tawakkul ke khilaf nahi) phir mein masjid ke andar gaya aur do rakat namaz padhi phir bahar nikla to Jibrail alaihissalam do bartan le kar aaye aik mein sharaab aur doosray mein doodh tha mein ne doodh pasand kiya to Jibrail ne kaha Aap ne fitrat ko pasand kiya phir Jibrail alaihissalam mujhe aasmaan par le kar gaye (jab wahan pahunche) to farishton se darwaza kholnay ke liye kaha unhon ne poocha kaun hai Jibrail ne kaha ke Jibrail hai unhon ne kaha ke tumharay saath doosra kaun hai Jibrail alaihissalam ne kaha ke Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hain farishton ne poocha ke kiya wo bulaye gaye thay Jibrail alaihissalam ne kaha ke haan bulaye gaye hain phir hamaray liye darwaza khola gaya aur mein ne Adam alaihissalam ko dekha to unhon ne mujhe marhaba kaha aur mere liye behtari ki dua ki phir Jibrail alaihissalam hamaray saath doosray aasmaan par charhe aur darwaza khulwaya farishton ne poocha ke kaun hai unhon ne kaha ke Jibrail farishton ne poocha ke tumharay saath doosra kaun shakhs hai unhon ne kaha ke Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hain farishton ne kaha ke un ko bulanay ka hukm hua tha Jibrail alaihissalam ne kaha ke haan hukm hua hai phir darwaza khula to mein ne donon khala zaad bhaiyon ko dekha yani Isa bin Maryam aur Yahya bin Zakariya alaihimas salam ko un donon ne marhaba kaha aur mere liye behtari ki dua ki phir Jibrail alaihissalam hamaray saath teesray aasmaan par charhe aur darwaza khulwaya to farishton ne kaha ke kaun hai Jibrail alaihissalam ne kaha ke Jibrail farishton ne kaha ke tumharay saath doosra kaun hai Jibrail alaihissalam ne kaha ke Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hain farishton ne kaha ke kiya un ko bulanay ke liye paigham gaya tha Jibrail alaihissalam ne kaha ke haan paigham gaya tha phir darwaza khula to mein ne Yusuf alaihissalam ko dekha Allah ne Hasan (khoobsurati) ka aadha hissa un ko diya tha unhon ne mujhe marhaba kaha aur naik dua ki phir Jibrail alaihissalam hamein le kar chauthay aasmaan par charhe aur darwaza khulwaya to farishton ne poocha ke kaun hai Jibrail alaihissalam ne kaha ke Jibrail unhon ne poocha ke tumharay saath doosra kaun hai Jibrail alaihissalam ne kaha ke Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hain farishton ne kaha ke ke wo bulwaye gaye hain Jibrail alaihissalam ne kaha ke haan bulwaye gaye hain phir darwaza khula to mein ne Idrees alaihissalam ko dekha unhon ne marhaba kaha aur mujhe achi dua di Allah Jal Jalaluhu ne farmaya hai ke ” ham ne Idrees ko oonchi jagah par utha liya “ (to oonchi jagah se yehi chautha aasmaan muraad hai) phir Jibrail alaihissalam hamaray saath paanchwin aasmaan par charhe aur unhon ne darwaza khulwaya farishton ne poocha ke kaun kaha ke Jibrail farishton ne poocha ke tumharay saath kaun hai Jibrail alaihissalam ne kaha ke Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hain farishton ne kaha ke kiya wo bulaye gaye hain Jibrail alaihissalam ne kaha ke haan bulwaye gaye hain phir darwaza khula to mein ne Haaroon alaihissalam ko dekha unhon ne marhaba kaha aur mujhe naik dua di phir Jibrail alaihissalam hamaray saath chhatay aasmaan par pahunche aur darwaza khulwaya farishton ne poocha ke kaun hai Jibrail alaihissalam ne kaha ke Jibrail farishton ne poocha ke tumharay saath aur kaun hai unhon ne kaha ke Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hain farishton ne kaha ke Allah ne un ko le kar aanay ke liye paigham bheja tha Jibrail alaihissalam ne kaha haan ! bheja tha phir darwaza khula to mein ne Musa alaihissalam ko dekha unhon ne marhaba kaha aur mujhe achi dua di phir Jibrail alaihissalam hamaray saath saatwin aasmaan par charhe aur darwaza khulwaya farishton ne poocha ke kaun hai Jibrail alaihissalam ne kaha ke Jibrail hun poocha ke tumharay saath aur kaun hai Jibrail alaihissalam ne kaha ke Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hain farishton ne poocha ke kiya wo bulwaye gaye hain unhon ne kaha ke haan bulwaye gaye hain phir darwaza khula to mein ne Ibrahim alaihissalam ko dekha ke wo bait al-Ma'moor se apni peeth ka takiya lagao hue baithay thay (us se maloom hua ke qibla ki taraf peeth kar ke baithna gunah nahi) aur us mein har roz satr hazaar farishtay jatay hain ke phir kabhi un ki baari nahi aaye gi phir Jibrail alaihissalam mujhe Sidrat-ul-Muntaha ke paas le gaye us ke pattay itnay baray thay jaisay haathi ke kaan aur us ke bair qulla jaisay (aik bara ghara jis mein do mushk ya zyada pani aata hai) phir jab us darakht ko Allah Taala ke hukm ne dhaanka to us ka haal aisa ho gaya ke koi makhlooq us ki khoobsurati bayan nahi kar sakti phir Allah Jal Jalaluhu ne mere dil mein ilqa kiya jo kuch ilqa kiya aur pachaas namazein raat aur din mein mujh par farz kein jab mein wahan se utra aur Musa alaihissalam tak pahuncha to unhon ne poocha ke tumharay Rab ne tumhari ummat par kiya farz kiya mein ne kaha ke pachaas namazein farz ki hain unhon ne kaha ke phir apne Rab ki taraf laut jao aur takhfeef chaho kyunke tumhari ummat ko itni taqat na ho gi aur mein ne Bani Israil ko aazmaya aur un ka imtihan liya hai mein apne Rab ke paas laut gaya aur arz kiya ke Ae Rab ! meri ummat par takhfeef kar Allah Taala ne paanch namazein ghata dein mein laut kar Musa alaihissalam ke paas aaya aur kaha ke paanch namazein Allah Taala ne mujhe maaf kar dein unhon ne kaha tumhari ummat ko itni taqat na ho gi tum phir apne Rab ke paas jao aur takhfeef karao Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mein us tarah barabar apne Rab ke darmiyan aata jata raha yahan tak ke Allah Jal Jalaluhu ne farmaya ke Ae Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ! har din aur raat mein paanch namazein hain aur har aik namaz mein das namazon ka sawab hai to wohi pachaas namazein huein (SubhanAllah Allah ! Maalik ki apne bandon par kaisi inayat hai ke padhein to paanch namazein aur sawab pachaas namazon ka milay) aur jo koi shakhs naik kaam karnay ki niyyat karay aur phir us ko na kar sakay to us ko aik neki ka sawab milay ga aur jo karay to us ko das naikiyon ka aur jo shakhs burayi karnay ki niyyat karay aur phir us ko na karay to kuch na likha jaye ga aur agar kar le to aik hi burayi likhi jaye gi phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mein utra aur Musa alaihissalam ke paas aaya to unhon ne kaha ke phir apne Rab ke paas laut jao aur takhfeef chaho Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mein apne Rab ke paas baar gaya yahan tak ke mein us se sharma gaya hun (yani ab janay se sharmaata hun)"
"77","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` ham Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath Makka aur Madina ke darmiyan chal rahay thay ke aik waadi par guzray Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne poocha ke ye kaun si waadi hai logon ne kaha ke waadi Azraq hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke goya mein Musa alaihissalam ko dekh raha hun (phir Musa alaihissalam ka rang aur baalon ka haal bayan kiya jo (rawi hadees) Dawood bin Abu Hind ko yaad na raha) jo ungliyan apne kaanon mein rakhay hue buland aawaz se talbiya pukaartay hue us waadi mein se ja rahay hain Abdullah raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke ham phir chalay yahan tak ke aik tekri par aaye Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke ye kaun si tekri hai logon ne kaha ke ’ Harsha ‘ ki ya ’ Lift ‘ ki Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : goya ke mein Yunus alaihissalam ko dekh raha hun ke soof ka aik jubba pehnay hue aik surkh oontni par sawaar hain aur un ki oontni ki nakeel khajoor ke chhaal ki hai wo us waadi mein labbaik kehtay hue ja rahay hain"
"78","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke jab mujhe Mi'raaj karayi gayi to mein Musa alaihissalam se mila phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne un ki soorat bayan ki mein khayal karta hun ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne yun farmaya (ye shak rawi hai) ke wo lambay chhuriray badan walay siyah baalon walay jaisay Shanooa ke log hotay thay aur farmaya ke mein Isa alaihissalam se mila phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne un ki soorat bayan ki ke wo darmiyaana qad walay surkh rangat walay jaisay ke abhi koi Humaam se nikla ho (yani aisay tarotaaza aur khush rang) thay aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mein ne Ibrahim alaihissalam ko dekha to mein un ki aulad mein sab se zyada un se mushaabeh hun Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke phir mere paas do bartan laaye gaye aik mein doodh tha aur aik mein sharaab aur mujh se kaha gaya ke jis ko chaho pasand kar lo mein ne doodh ka bartan le liya aur doodh piya to us (farishtay ne jo ye donon bartan le kar aaya tha) kaha ke tum ko fitrat (hidayat) ki raah mili ya tum fitrat (hidayat) ko pahunch gaye aur agar tum sharaab ko ikhtiyar kartay to tumhari ummat gumrah ho jati"
"79","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aik din logon ke darmiyan Masih Dajjal ka zikr kiya to farmaya : ke Allah Jal Jalaluhu kana nahi hai aur Masih Dajjal daahni aankh se kana hai us ki kaani aankh aisi hai jaisay phoola hua angoor (pas yehi aik khuli nishani hai us baat ki ke wo mardood apne khudayi da'way mein jhoota hai) Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke aik raat khwab mein mein ne apne Aap ko Kaaba ke paas dekha ke aik gandumi rang ka shakhs jaisay koi bohat acha gandumi rang ka shakhs hota hai us ke baal kandhon tak thay aur baalon mein kanghi ki hui thi sar mein se pani tapak raha tha aur wo apne donon haath do aadmiyon ke kandhon par rakhay hue khana Kaaba ka tawaaf kar raha tha mein ne poocha ke kaun shakhs hai logon ne kaha ke ye Maryam ke betay Masih alaihimas salam hain aur un ke peechay mein ne aik aur shakhs ko dekha jo ke sakht ghunghryalay baalon wala daahni aankh ka kana tha mein ne jo log dekhay un sab mein bin Qatan us se zyada mushaabeh hai wo bhi apne donon haath do aadmiyon ke kandhon par rakhay hue tawaaf kar raha tha mein ne poocha ke ye kaun hai logon ne kaha ke ye Masih Dajjal hai"
"80","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : mein ne apne Aap ko Hateem mein dekha aur (dekha ke) Quraish mujh se meri sair (Mi'raaj) ka haal pooch rahay thay to unhon ne bait Bait-ul-Maqdis ki kai cheezein poochein jin ko mein zehn mein mehfooz nahi rakhta tha mujhe bara ranj hua aisa ranj kabhi nahi hua tha phir Allah Taala ne bait Bait-ul-Maqdis ko utha kar mere saamnay kar diya mein us ko dekhnay laga aur ab jo baat wo poochtay to mein bata deta tha aur mein ne apne Aap ko paighambaron ki jamaat mein paya dekha ke Musa alaihissalam kharay hue namaz padh rahay hain wo aik darmiyaana qad aur guthay hue jism ke shakhs hain jaisay ke (qabeela) Shanooa ke log hotay hain aur Isa bin Maryam alaihimas salam ko bhi dekha ke wo bhi kharay hue namaz padh rahay hain aur mein un ke sab se zyada mushaabeh Urwa bin Mas'ud Saqafi raziyallahu anhu ko pata hun aur dekha ke Ibrahim alaihissalam bhi kharay hue namaz padh rahay hain un ke sab se zyada mushaabeh tumharay saahib (yani apne Aap ko muraad liya) hain aur phir namaz ka waqt aaya to mein ne imamat ki aur sab paighambaron ne mere peechay namaz padhi jab mein namaz se farigh hua to aik bolnay wala bola ke Ae Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ! ye jahannam ka daarogha ” Maalik “ hai us ko salam karo mein ne us ki taraf dekha to us ne khud pehle mujhe salam kiya"
"81","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` jab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko Mi'raaj karayi gayi to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Sidrat-ul-Muntaha tak le jaya gaya aur wo chhatay aasmaan mein hai zameen se jo charhta hai wo yeein aa kar thehar jata hai phir le liya jata hai aur jo upar se utarta hai wo bhi yeein theharta hai phir le liya jata hai Allah Azza wa Jal ne farmaya ke ” jabke Sidra (bairi) ko chhupaye leti thi wo cheez jo us par chha rahi thi “ (Najm : 16) Abdullah raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke yani sonay ke patangay phir Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko wahan teen cheezein di gayein aik to paanch namazein doosri Surah Baqarah ki aakhri aayaat aur teesray Allah Taala ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki ummat mein se us shakhs ko bakhsh diya jo Allah ke saath shirk na karay ga (baaqi tamam tabah karnay walay gunaahon ko maaf kar diya jata hai siwae shirk ke)"
"82","[AI-translation] ´Shaibaani se riwayat hai wo kehtay hain ke` mein ne Zirr bin Hubaish raziyallahu anhu se Allah Taala ke us qaul ” pas wo do kamaanon ke baqadr faasla reh gaya balke us se bhi kam “ (Surah : Najm : 9) ke baaray mein poocha to unhon ne kaha ke mujh se Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) ne bayan kiya ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Jibrail alaihissalam ko dekha tha un ke chhe sau par thay"
"83","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) Allah Taala ke qaul` ” dil ne jhoot nahi kaha jisay (paighambar ne) dekha .... usay to aik martaba aur bhi dekha tha “ (Surah : Najm : 11, 13) ki tafseer mein kehtay hain ke Rasoolullah ne Allah Taala ko apne dil se do baar dekha (Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ka ye apna nuqta nazar hai) (meem-ain)"
"84","[AI-translation] ´Masrooq se riwayat hai ke` mein Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ke paas takiya lagao hue baitha tha to unhon ne kaha ke Ae Abu Aayisha ! (ye Masrooq ki kunniyat hai) teen baatein aisi hain ke jo koi un ka qaayil ho us ne Allah Taala par bara jhoot baandha mein ne kaha ke wo teen baatein kaun si hain unhon ne kaha ke (aik ye hai ke) jo koi samjhay ke Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Allah Taala ko dekha hai us ne Allah par bara jhoot baandha Masrooq ne kaha ke mein takiya lagao hue tha ye sun kar mein baith gaya aur kaha ke Ae Umm ul-Momineen ! zara mujhe baat karnay do aur jaldi mat karo kiya Allah Taala ne nahi farmaya ke ” us ne us ko aasmaan ke khulay kinaaray par dekha bhi hai “ (Surah : at-Takweer : 23) ” usay aik martaba aur bhi dekha tha “ (Najm : 13) Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke us ummat mein sab se pehle mein ne un aayaton ke mutaliq Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se poocha to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke un aayaton se muraad Jibrail alaihissalam hain mein ne un ko un ki asali soorat par nahi dekha siwa do baar ke jin ka zikr un aayaton mein hai mein ne un ko dekha ke wo aasmaan se utar rahay thay aur un ke jism ki barayi ne aasmaan se zameen tak ke faasla ko bhar diya tha phir Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke kiya to ne nahi suna ke Allah Taala farmata hai ke ” us (Allah) ko to kisi ki nigaah nahi dekh sakti aur wo sab nigaahon ko dekh sakta hai aur wohi bara baareek bain baakhabar hai “ (Surah : An'aam : 103) kiya to ne nahi suna ke Allah Taala farmata hai ke ” naamumkin hai ke kisi banda se Allah Taala kalaam karay magar wahi ke zariya ya parday ke peechay se ya kisi farishta ko bhejay aur wo Allah ke hukm se jo wo chahay wahi karay beshak wo bartar hai hikmat wala hai “ (Surah : ash-Shoora : 51) (doosri ye hai ke) jo koi khayal karay ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Allah Taala ki kitab mein se kuch chhupa liya to us ne (bhi) Allah Taala par bara jhoot baandha Allah Taala farmata hai ke ” Ae Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ! jo kuch bhi Aap ki taraf Aap ke Rab ki jaanib se naazil kiya gaya hai pahuncha dijiye agar Aap ne aisa na kiya to Aap ne Allah ki risalat ada nahi ki “ (Maaida : 67) Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke aur jo koi kahay ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam kal honay wali baat jantay thay (yani aainda ka haal ghaib ki baat) to us ne (bhi) Allah Taala par bara jhoot baandha Allah Taala khud farmata hai ke ” (Ae Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam !) keh dijiye ke aasmanon aur zameen mein Allah ke siwa koi ghaib ki baat nahi janta “ aur Dawood ne itna zyada kiya hai ke Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke agar Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam us (yani Quran) mein se kuch chhupanay walay hotay jo ke un par naazil kiya gaya hai (yani Quran) to us aayat ko chhupatay ke (yaad karo) jab ke to us shakhs se keh raha tha jis par Allah ne bhi inaam kiya aur to ne bhi ke to apni biwi ko apne paas rakh aur Allah se darr aur to apne dil mein wo baat chhupaye hue tha jisay Allah zaahir karnay wala tha aur to logon se khauf khata tha halanke Allah Taala us ka zyada haqdar tha ke to us se darre “ (Surah : Ahzaab : 37)"
"85","[AI-translation] ´Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne kharay ho kar aisi paanch baatein sunaayein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : 1 Allah Jal Jalaluhu sota nahi aur sona us ke laiq hi nahi (kyunke sona azlaat aur a'za badan ki thakaawat se hota aur Allah Taala thakan se paak hai doosray ye ke sona ghaflat hai aur maut ke misl hai aur Allah Taala us se paak hai) 2 aur wohi taraazu ko jhukata aur us ko ooncha karta hai 3 usi ki taraf raat ka amal din ke amal se pehle aur din ka amal raat ke amal se pehle uthaya jata hai 4 us ka parda noor hai aik riwayat mein hai ke us ka parda aag hai 5 agar wo us parday ko khol de to us ke munh ki shuayein jahan tak us ki nigaah pahunchti hai makhlooqat ko jala dein"
"86","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` kuch logon ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se poocha ke kiya qayamat ke roz ham apne Rab ko dekhein ge to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : kiya tum chaudhween raat ka chaand dekhnay mein aik doosray ko takleef detay ho (yani izdihaam aur hujoom ki wajah se) ya tumhein chaudhween raat ka chaand dekhnay mein kuch takleef hoti hai logon ne kaha ke nahi Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke bhala tumhein sooraj ke dekhnay mein jis waqt ke baadal na ho (aur aasmaan saaf ho) kuch mashaqqat hoti hai ya aik doosray ko sadma pahunchatay ho logon ne kaha nahi Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke phir usi tarah (yani baghair takleef mashaqqat zehmat aur izdihaam ke) tum apne Rab ko dekho ge Allah Taala logon ko qayamat ke din jama karay ga to farmaye ga ke jo koi jis ko poojta tha usi ke saath ho jaye phir jo shakhs sooraj ko poojta tha wo sooraj ke saath ho jaye ga aur jo chaand ko poojta tha wo chaand ke saath aur jo Taghoot ko poojta tha wo Taghoot ke saath ho jaye ga bas ye ummat Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) baaqi reh jaye gi jis mein munafiq log bhi hun ge phir Allah Taala un ke paas aisi soorat mein aaye ga ke jis ko wo na pehchanein ge aur kahay ga ke mein tumhara Rab hun wo kahein ge ke ham tujh se Allah ki panah maango hain aur ham usi jagah thehray rahein ge yahan tak ke hamara Rab aaye ga to ham us ko pehchan lein ge phir Allah Taala un ke paas us soorat mein aaye ga jis ko wo pehchantay hun ge aur kahay ga ke mein tumhara Rab hun to wo kahein ge ke to hamara Rab hai phir wo us ke saath ho jayein ge aur dozakh ki pusht par pul rakha jaye ga to mein aur meri ummat sab se pehle paar hun ge aur siwae paighambaron ke aur koi us din baat na kar sakay ga aur paighambaron ka bol us waqt ye ho ga ke ya Allah bachaaiyo ! (ye shafqat ki wajah se kahein ge makhlooq par) aur dozakh mein karay hain (lohay ke jin ka sar tairha hota hai aur tanoor mein jab gosht daaltay hain to karon mein laga kar daaltay hain) jaisay Sa'daan jhaari ke kaantay (Sa'daan aik kaanton daar jhaari hai) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne sahaba se farmaya ke kiya tum ne Sa'daan jhaari dekhi hai unhon ne kaha haan dekhi hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke pas wo Sa'daan ke aankray kaanton ki shakal par hun ge lekin siwae Allah Taala ke ye koi nahi janta ke wo karay kitnay baray baray hun ge wo logon ko dozakh mein ghaseetein ge (yani farishtay un karon se dozakhiyon ko ghaseet lein ge) un ke badamlon ki wajah se ab baaz un mein barbaad hun ge jo apne badamal ke sabab se barbaad ho jayein ge aur baaz un mein se apne aamaal ka badla diye jayein ge yahan tak ke jab Allah Taala bandon ke faislay se faraaghat paye ga aur chahay ga ke dozakh walon mein se jis ko chahay apni rehmat se nikalay to farishton ko hukm de ga dozakh se us shakhs ko nikaalein jis ne Allah ke saath kisi cheez ko shareek na kiya ho jis par Allah ne rehmat karni chaahi ho jo ke la ilaah illa Allah kehta ho ga to farishtay dozakh mein aisay logon ko pehchan lein ge aur wo unhein sajdon ke nishan se pehchanein ge aag aadmi ko jala daalay gi siwae sajday ke nishan ki jagah ke (kyunke) Allah Taala ne aag par us jagah ka jalana haraam kiya hai phir wo dozakh se Jale bhunnay nikalay jayein ge tab un par aab hayaat chhirka jaye ga to wo taaza ho kar aisay jam uthein ge jaisay gandum pani ke bahao mein jam uthta hai (pani jahan par kora kachra mitti baha kar lata hai wahan gandum khoob ugta hai aur jald shaadaab aur sarsabz ho jata hai usi tarah wo jahannami bhi aab hayaat daaltay hi taazay ho jayein ge aur jalan ke nishan bilkul jatay rahein ge) phir jab Allah Taala bandon ke faislay se farigh ho ga aur aik mard baaqi reh jaye ga jis ka munh dozakh ki taraf ho ga aur ye jannat mein daakhil honay wala aakhri shakhs ho ga wo kahay ga ke Ae Rab ! mera munh jahannam ki taraf se pher de kyunke us ki boo mujhe eeza mein daalnay wali aur us ki garmi mujhe Jalaye de rahi hai phir Allah se dua karay ga jab tak Allah Taala ko manzoor ho ga us ke baad Allah Taala farmaye ga ke agar mein tera sawal poora karun to to aur sawal karay ga wo kahay ga ke nahi phir mein kuch sawal na karun ga aur jaisay jaisay Allah ko manzoor hun ge wo qaul iqraar karay ga tab Allah Taala us ka munh dozakh ki taraf se (jannat ki taraf) pher de ga jab jannat ki taraf us ka munh ho ga to jab tak Allah Taala ko manzoor ho ga chup rahay ga phir kahay ga ke Ae Rab mujhe jannat ke darwazay tak pahuncha de Allah Taala farmaye ga ke to kiya kiya qaul aur iqraar kar chuka hai ke phir mein doosra sawal na karun ga bura ho tera Ae aadmi to kaisa dhokebaaz hai wo kahay ga ke Ae Rab ! aur dua karay ga yahan tak ke Allah Taala farmaye ga ke acha agar mein tera ye sawal poora kar dun to phir to aur kuch maangay ga wo kahay ga ke nahi qasam teri izzat ki aur kiya kiya qaul aur iqraar karay ga jaisay Allah ko manzoor ho ga aakhir Allah Taala us ko jannat ke darwazay tak pahuncha de ga jab wahan khara ho ga to saari jannat us ko dikhayi de gi aur jo kuch us mein nemat ya khushi aur farhat hai wo sab phir aik muddat tak jab tak Allah ko manzoor ho ga wo chup rahay ga us ke baad arz karay ga ke Ae Rab ! mujhe jannat ke andar le ja Allah Taala farmaye ga ke kiya to ne kiya pukhta waada aur iqraar nahi kiya tha ke ab mein kuch sawal na karun ga bura ho tera Ae Adam ke betay ! to kaisa dhoka baaz hai wo arz karay ga ke Ae mere Rab mein teri makhlooq mein badnaseeb nahi hun ga aur dua karta rahay ga yahan tak ke Allah Jal shaana hans de ga aur jab Allah Taala ko hansi aa jaye gi to farmaye ga ke acha ja jannat mein chala ja jab wo jannat ke andar jaye ga to Allah Taala us se farmaye ga ke ab to koi aur aarzu kar wo karay ga aur maangay ga yahan tak ke Allah Taala us ko yaad dilaye ga ke falan cheez maang falan cheez maang jab us ki aarzooaein khatm ho jayein gi to haq Taala farmaye ga ke ham ne ye sab cheezein tujhe dein aur un ke saath itni hi aur dein (yani apni khwahishon se do guna le SubhanAllah Allah ! kiya karam aur rehmat hai Allah Taala ki apne bandon par aur agar wo karam na karay to aur kaun karay wohi Maalik hai wohi Khaaliq hai wohi Raaziq hai wo paalnay wala hai) Ata bin Yazid ne kaha jo us hadees ke rawi hain ke Abu Sa'eed Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) bhi us hadees ki riwayat karnay mein Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ke muwafiq thay kahein khilaf na thay lekin jab Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ne ye kaha ke Allah Taala us se farmaye ga ke ham ne ye sab tujhe dein aur itni hi aur dein to Abu Sa'eed Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Ae Abu Huraira ! us ke misl das guna aur bhi to Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke mujhe to yehi baat yaad hai ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne yun farmaya ke ham ne ye sab tujhe dein aur itni hi aur dein Abu Sa'eed Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke mein gawahi deta hun ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne yun farmaya ke ham ne ye sab tujhe dein aur das hissay zyada dein Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ye wo shakhs hai jo sab se aakhir mein jannat mein jaye ga (to aur jannatiyon ko maloom nahi kiya kiya nematein milein gi)"
"87","[AI-translation] ´Abu Sa'eed Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : wo log jo jahannam walay hain (yani hamesha wahan rehnay ke liye hain jaisay kafir aur mushrik) wo to na marein ge na jiyein ge lekin kuch log jo gunaahon ki wajah se dozakh mein jayein ge Allah Taala un par maut taari karay ga yahan tak ke wo Jal kar koyla ho jayein ge to un ke liye shafaat ki ijazat ho gi aur ye log giroh dar giroh laaye jayein ge aur jannat ki neheron par phailaye jayein ge aur hukm ho ga ke Ae jannat ke logon ! un par pani daalo tab wo us tarah se ugein ge jaisay gandum us mitti mein ugta hai jis ko pani baha kar lata hai (ye sun kar) aik shakhs bola ke goya Rasoolullah ! (maloom hota hai) Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jungle mein rahay hain (jabhi to Aap ko ye maloom hai ke bahao mein jo mitti jama hoti hai us mein gandum khoob ugta hai)"
"88","[AI-translation] ´Anas (raziyallahu anhu) aur Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) riwayat kartay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : sab se aakhir mein jo shakhs jannat mein jaye ga wo aik aisa shakhs ho ga jo chalay ga phir aundha gire ga aur jahannam ki aag us ko jalati jaye gi jab dozakh se paar ho jaye ga to peeth mor kar us ko dekhay ga aur kahay ga ke bari barkat wali hai wo zaat jis ne mujhe tujh (jahannam) se nijaat di beshak jitna Allah Taala ne mujhe diya hai itna aglon pichhlon mein se kisi ko nahi diya phir us ko aik darakht dikhayi de ga wo kahay ga ke Ae Rab mujhe us darakht ke qareeb kar de taake mein us ke saya mein rahun aur us ka pani pion Allah Taala farmaye ga ke Ae Adam ke betay ! agar mein ne tera ye sawal poora kar diya to to aur bhi sawal karay ga wo kahay ga ke nahi Ae mere Rab ! aur ehad karay ga ke phir mein koi sawal na karun ga aur Allah Taala us ka uzr qabool kar le ga us liye ke wo aisi nemat ko dekhay ga jis par us se sabr nahi ho sakta (yani insaan be sabr hai jab wo takleef mein mubtala ho aur aish ki baat dekhay to be ikhtiyar us ki khwahish karta hai) aakhir Allah Taala us ko us darakht ke qareeb kar de ga aur wo us ke saya mein rahay ga aur wahan ka pani piye ga phir us ko aik aur darakht dikhayi de ga jo us se bhi acha ho ga wo kahay ga ke Ae Rab mujhe us darakht ke qareeb pahuncha de taake mein us ke saye mein jaun aur us ka pani pion aur mein aur kuch sawal na karun ga Allah Taala farmaye ga ke Ae Adam ke betay ! kiya to ne ehad nahi kiya tha ke mein phir sawal na karun ga aur agar mein tujhe us darakht tak pahuncha dun to phir to aur sawal karay ga wo iqraar karay ga ke nahi phir mein aur kuch sawal na karun ga Allah Taala us ko mazoor rakhay ga us liye ke us ko us nemat par jo wo (shakhs) dekhta hai sabr nahi tab Allah Taala us ko us darakht ke qareeb kar de ga wo us ke saye mein rahay ga aur wahan ka pani piye ga phir us ko aik darakht dikhayi de ga jo jannat ke darwazay par ho ga aur wo pehle ke donon darakhton se behtar ho ga wo kahay ga ke Ae mere Rab ! mujhe us darakht ke paas pahuncha de taake mein us ke neechay saya mein rahun aur wahan ka pani pion ab mein aur kuch sawal na karun ga Allah Taala farmaye ga ke Ae Adam ke betay ! kiya to iqraar na kar chuka tha ke ab mein aur kuch sawal na karun ga wo kahay ga ke beshak mein iqraar kar chuka tha lekin ab mera ye sawal poora kar de phir mein aur kuch sawal na karun ga Allah Taala us ko mazoor rakhay ga us liye ke wo un nematon ko dekhay ga jin par wo sabr nahi kar sakta aakhir Allah Taala us ko us darakht ke paas kar de ga jab wo us darakht ke paas jaye ga to jannat walon ki aawazein sunay ga aur kahay ga ke Ae mere Rab ! mujhe jannat ke andar pahuncha de Allah Taala farmaye ga ke Ae Adam ke betay ! tere sawal ko kaun si cheez poora karay gi (yani teri khwahish kab mauqoof ho gi aur ye baar sawal karna kaisay band ho ga) bhala to us par raazi hai ke mein tujhe saari duniya ke barabar de kar itna hi aur dun wo kahay ga ke Ae mere Rab ! to saaray jahan ka Maalik ho kar mujh se mazaaq karta hai phir Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) hansnay lagay aur logon se kaha ke tum mujh se poochtay nahi ke mein kyun hansta hun logon ne poocha ke tum kyun hanstay ho to unhon ne kaha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam bhi (us hadees ko bayan kar ke) usi tarah hansay thay logon ne poocha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Aap kyun hanstay hain to Aap ne farmaya ke Rab Aalameen ke hansnay se mein bhi hansta hun jab wo banda ye kahay ga ke to saaray jahaan ka Maalik ho kar mujh se mazaaq karta hai to Rab hans de ga (us ki naadaani aur bewaqoofi par) aur Allah farmaye ga ke mein tujh se mazaaq nahi karta (mazaaq karna mere laiq nahi wo bandon ke laiq hai) balke mein jo chahta hun kar sakta hun"
"89","[AI-translation] ´Zubair ne Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat ki hai ke` Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) se qayamat ke din logon ke aanay ke haal ke baaray mein poocha gaya to unhon ne kaha ke ham qayamat ke din us tarah se aayein ge yani ye upar sab aadmiyon ke phir sab ummatein apne apne buton aur maboodon ke saath pukaari jayein gi pehli ummat phir doosri ummat us ke baad hamara Rab aaye ga aur farmaye ga ke tum kis ka intezar kar rahay ho (yani ummat Muhammadi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se mukhatib ho kar irshaad farmaye ga) wo kahein ge ke ham apne Rab ka intezar kar rahay hain Allah Taala farmaye ga ke mein tumhara Maalik hun wo kahein ge ham tujh ko dekhein ge to tab (maloom ho ga) phir Allah un ko hansta hua dikhayi de ga aur un ke saath chalay ga aur sab log us ke peechay hun ge aur har aik aadmi ko khwah wo munafiq ho ya momin aik noor milay ga log us ke saath hun ge aur jahannam ke pul par aankray aur kaantay hun ge wo pakar lein ge jin ko Allah chahay ga us ke baad munafiqon ka noor bujh jaye ga aur momin nijaat payein ge to pehla giroh mominon ka (jo ho ga) un ke munh chaudhween raat ke chaand ke se hun ge (wo giroh) satr hazaar aadmiyon ka ho ga jin se hisab o kitab na ho ga un ke baad giroh khoob chamaktay sitaray ki tarah hun ge phir un ke baad ka un se kam yahan tak ke shafaat ka waqt aa jaye ga aur log shafaat karein ge aur jahannam se wo shakhs bhi nikala jaye ga jis ne la ilaah illa Allah kaha tha aur us ke dil mein aik jo ke barabar bhi neki aur behtari thi ye log jannat ke sehan mein daal diye jayein ge aur jinti log un par pani chhirakein ge (jis se) wo us tarah ugein ge jaisay jhaar pani ke bahao mein ugta hai aur un ki soz jalan bilkul jati rahay gi phir wo Allah se sawal karein ge aur har aik ko itna milay ga jaisay saari duniya balke us ke saath das guna aur bhi"
"90","[AI-translation] ´Yazid bin Suhaib faqeer se riwayat hai kehtay hain ke` mere dil mein kharijiyon ki aik baat khab gayi thi (aur wo ye ke kabeera gunah karnay wala hamesha hamesha jahannam mein rahay ga aur jo jahannam mein jaye ga wo phir wahan se na niklay ga) to ham aik bari jamaat ke saath us iraaday se niklay ke Hajj karein phir kharijiyon ka mazhab phailaayein ge jab ham muddinay mein pahunche to dekha ke Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) aik sutoon ke paas baithay hue logon ko Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki hadeesein suna rahay hain yakayak unhon ne dozakhiyon ka zikr kiya to mein ne kaha ke Ae sahabi Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ! tum kiya hadees bayan kartay ho Allah Taala to farmata hai ke ” Ae hamaray paalnay walay ! to jisay jahannam mein daalay yaqeenan to ne usay ruswa kiya “ (aal Imran : 192) naiz ” jab kabhi us se bahar nikalna chahein ge to usi mein lota diye jayein ge “ (as-Sajda : 20) aur ab ye tum kiya keh rahay ho unhon ne kaha ke to ne Quran padha hai mein ne kaha haan unhon ne phir kaha ke kiya to ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka muqaam suna hai (yani wo muqaam jo Allah Taala qayamat ke roz inayat farmaye ga) mein ne kaha ji haan ! mein ne suna hai unhon ne kaha ye hi Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke liye hai jis ki wajah se Allah Taala un logon ko jinhein chahay ga jahannam se nikalay ga phir unhon ne pul siraat ka haal aur us pul par se logon ke guzarnay ka haal bayan kiya aur aur mujhe darr hai ke shayad mujhe yaad na raha ho magar unhon ne ye kaha ke kuch log dozakh mein janay ke baad us mein se nikalay jayein ge aur wo us tarah niklein ge jaisay aabnoos ki lakriyan (siyah Jal bhun kar) phir jannat ki aik neher mein jayein ge aur wahan ghusl karein ge aur kaaghaz ki tarah safed ho kar niklein ge ye sun kar ham lautay aur ham ne kaha ke tumhari kharaabi ho ! kiya ye boorha Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par jhoot baandhta hai (yani wo hargiz jhoot nahi bolta phir tumhara mazhab ghalat nikla) aur ham sab apne mazhab se phir gaye magar aik shakhs na phira ya jaisa Abu Nuaym fazl bin Dukain (Imam Muslim ke ustaaz ke ustaaz) ne bayan kiya"
"91","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : dozakh se chaar aadmi nikalay jayein ge aur Allah tabaarak wa Taala ke saamnay kiye jayein ge un mein se aik jahannam ki taraf dekh kar kahay ga ke Ae mere Maalik ! jab to ne mujhe us (jahannam) se nijaat di hai to ab phir us mein mat le jana Allah Taala us ko jahannam se nijaat de ga"
"92","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` aik din Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas gosht laya gaya to dasti ka gosht Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko diya gaya wo Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko bohat pasand tha Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us ko daanton se nocha aur farmanay lagay ke mein qayamat ke din sab aadmiyon ka sardar hun ga aur kiya tum jantay ho ke kis wajah se qayamat ke din Allah Taala tamam aglon pichhlon ko aik hi maidaan mein ikaththa karay ga yahan tak ke pukaarnay walay ki aawaz un sab ko sunayi de gi aur dekhnay walay ki nigaah un sab par pahunche gi aur sooraj qareeb ho jaye ga aur logon par aisi museebat aur sakhti ho gi ke us ko wo seh na sakein ge aakhir aapas mein aik doosray se kahein ge ke dekho kaisi takleef ho rahi hai kiya koi sifarishi shafee nahi hai jo Allah Taala ke paas tumhari kuch sifarish karay baaz kahein ge ke Adam alaihissalam ke paas challu to sab ke sab Adam alaihissalam ke paas aayein ge aur un se kahein ge ke Aap tamam aadmiyon ke baap hain Allah Taala ne Aap ko apne haath se paida kiya apni taraf se rooh Aap mein phoonki aur farishton ko hukm kiya to unhon ne Aap ko sajda kiya Aap Rab se hamari shafaat kijiye kiya Aap nahi dekhtay ke ham kis haal mein hain aur kis qadar takleef mein hain Adam alaihissalam kahein ge ke aaj mera Rab apne ghussa mein hai ke na to us se pehle kabhi aisa ghussa hua tha aur na us ke baad kabhi ho ga aur us ne mujhe us darakht (ke phal) se mana kiya tha lekin mein ne (kha liya aur) ab mujhe khud apni fikr hai tum kisi aur ke paas jao Nooh alaihissalam ke paas jao phir log Nooh alaihissalam ke paas jayein ge aur kahein ge ke Ae Nooh ! alaihissalam tum sab paighambaron se pehle zameen par aaye Allah ne tumhara naam abdan shakooran (shukarguzaar banda) rakha hai tum apne Rab ke paas hamari sifarish karo kiya tum nahi dekhtay ham jis haal mein hain aur jo museebat ham par aayi hai wo kahein ge ke aaj Allah Taala itna ghussay mein hai ke na to aisa pehle kabhi hua aur na us ke baad ho ga aur mere wastay aik dua ka hukm tha (ke wo maqbool ho gi) wo mein apni ummat ke khilaf maang chuka (wo maqbool dua apni qaum par baddua ki shakal mein kar chuka hun jis se wo halaak ho gayi thi) us liye mujhe apni fikr hai tum Ibrahim alaihissalam ke paas jao phir sab Ibrahim alaihissalam ke paas aayein ge aur kahein ge ke Aap Allah ke Nabi aur saari zameen walon mein us ke dost hain Aap apne Rab ke haan hamari sifarish kijiye kiya Aap nahi dekhtay jis haal mein ham hain aur jo museebat ham par pari hai wo kahein ge ke mera Rab aaj bohat ghussay mein hai itna ghussay mein ke na to us se pehle kabhi aisa hua aur na us ke baad kabhi ho ga aur wo apni jhoot baaton ko bayan karein ge (jo unhon ne teen baar jhoot bola tha jo ke darasal tauriya tha) us liye mujhe khud apni fikr hai tum mere ilawa kisi doosray ke paas jao Musa ke paas jao wo log Musa alaihissalam ke paas jayein ge aur kahein ge ke Ae Musa alaihissalam ! Aap Allah ke Rasool hain Allah Taala ne Aap ko apne payaam (risalat) aur kalaam se tamam logon par fazeelat o buzrugi di hai Aap apne Rab se hamari sifarish kijiye kiya Aap nahi dekhtay ham jis haal mein hain aur jo museebat ham par pari hai Musa alaihissalam un se kahein ge ke aaj mera Rab aisay ghussay mein hai ke itna ghussay mein na us se pehle kabhi hua aur na us ke baad kabhi ho ga aur mein ne duniya mein aik shakhs ko qatl kiya tha jis ka mujhe hukm na tha us liye mujhe apni fikr pari hai tum Isa (alaihissalam) ke paas jao wo Isa alaihissalam ke paas aayein ge aur kahein ge Ae Isa ! Aap Allah ke Rasool hain Aap ne (maan ki) god mein logon se baatein kein aur us ka wo kalima hain jis ko us ne Maryam ki taraf daalnay tha aur us ki taraf se rooh hain Aap apne Rab se hamari sifarish kijiye kiya Aap nahi dekhtay ham jis haal mein hain aur jo museebat ham par pari hai Isa alaihissalam un se kahein ge ke aaj mera Rab bohat ghussay mein hai itna ghussay mein ke na us se pehle kabhi hua aur na us ke baad kabhi ho ga (aur un ka koi gunah bayan nahi kiya) mujhe to khud apni fikr hai tum aur kisi ke paas jao Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas jao to wo log mere (Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aayein ge aur arz karein ge ke Ae Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ! Aap Allah ke Rasoolullah aur Khaatam ul Ambiya hain aur Allah Taala ne Aap ke aglay pichlay sab gunah bakhsh diye hain Aap apne Rab se hamari sifarish kijiye kiya Aap hamara haal nahi dekhtay kiya Aap nahi dekhtay ke ham kis museebat mein hain pas mein ye suntay hi (maidaan hashr se) chalon ga aur arsh ke neechay aa kar apne Rab ko sajda karun ga phir Allah Taala mera dil khol de ga aur apni wo wo tareefein aur khoobiyan batlaye ga jo mujh se pehle kisi ko nahi batlayein (mein us ki khoob tareef aur hamd karun ga) phir (Allah Taala) kahay ga ke Ae Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ! sar utha aur maang jo maangay ga diya jaye ga sifarish kar qabool ki jaye gi mein sar uthaon ga aur arz karun ga Ae mere Rab meri ummat par rehem farma Ae mere Rab meri ummat par rehem farma hukm ho ga ke Ae Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ! apni ummat mein se jin logon se koi hisab kitab nahi ho ga un ko jannat ke daahnay darwazay se daakhil karo aur wo jannat ke baaqi doosray darwazon mein bhi doosray logon ke shareek hain (yani un darwazon mein se bhi ja saktay hain lekin ye darwaza un ke liye makhsoos hai) (Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke) qasam us ki jis ke haath mein Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki jaan hai ! ke jannat ke aik darwazay ki chaurayi aisi hai jaisay Makka aur Hijr (Bahrain ke aik sheher ka naam hai) ke darmiyan ka faasla ya Makka aur Basra (mulk shaam ka sheher) ke darmiyan ka faasla (rawi ko shak hai)"
"93","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : mein sab se pehle jannat (ke baaray) mein sifarish karun ga aur kisi paighambar ko itnay logon ne nahi maana (pairwi nahi ki) jitnay logon ne mujhe maana (meri pairwi ki) aur koi paighambar to aisa hai ke us ka maannay wala (iman lanay wala) aik hi shakhs tha"
"94","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : mein qayamat ke din jannat ke darwazay par aaun ga aur darwaza khulwaaon ga chaukidaar poochay ga ke tum kaun ho mein kahun ga ke mein Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hun wo kahay ga ke mujhe Aap hi ke wastay hukm hua tha ke Aap se pehle kisi ke liye darwaza na kholon"
"95","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : har Nabi ki aik dua hai jo zaroor qabool hoti hai aur har Nabi ne jaldi kar ke wo dua (duniya hi mein) maang li aur mein apni dua ko qayamat ke din ke liye apni ummat ki shafaat ke liye chhupa kar rakhta hun aur Allah ke hukm se (meri) shafaat har us Ummti ke liye ho gi jo haal mein faut hua ke us ne Allah ke saath shirk nahi kiya"
"96","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Ibrahim alaihissalam ke baaray mein Allah Taala ke us qaul ki tilawat farmayi ke ” Ae mere paalnay walay (mabood) unhon ne bohat se logon ko raah se bhatka diya hai pas meri taabedaari karnay wala mera hai aur jo meri nafarmani karay to to bohat hi maaf karnay wala aur rehem karnay wala hai “ (Surah : Ibrahim : 36) aur Isa alaihissalam ka qaul (jo ke Quran paak mein manqool hai) ke ” agar to un ko saza de to ye tere banday hain aur agar to un ko maaf farma de to to zabardast hai hikmat wala hai “ phir Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apne donon haath uthaye aur kaha ke Ae mere Rab ! meri ummat meri ummat aur ronay lagay Allah Taala ne farmaya ke Ae Jibrail ! tum Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas jao aur tera Rab khoob janta hai lekin tum ja kar un se poocho ke wo kyun rotay hain Jibrail alaihissalam Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaye aur poocha ke Aap kyun rotay hain Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne sab haal bayan kiya Jibrail ne Allah Taala se ja kar arz kiya halanke wo to khud khoob janta tha Allah Taala ne farmaya ke Ae Jibrail ! Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas ja aur keh ke ham tumhein tumhari ummat ke baaray mein khush kar dein ge aur naraaz nahi karein ge"
"97","[AI-translation] ´Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Tufail bin Amr Dausi raziyallahu anhu Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaye (Makka mein hijrat se pehle) aur arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Aap aik mazboot qila aur lashkar chahtay hain (us qila ke liye kaha jo ke jahiliyat ke zamana mein Daus ka tha) Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us wajah se qabool na kiya ke Allah Taala ne Ansaar ke hissay mein ye baat likh di thi ke (Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam un ke paas un ki himaayat aur hifazat mein rahein ge) phir jab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Madina ki taraf hijrat ki to Tufail bin Amr raziyallahu anhu ne bhi hijrat ki aur un ke saath un ki qaum ke aik shakhs ne bhi hijrat ki phir Madina ki hua un ko naamuwafiq hui (aur un ke pait mein a'ariza paida hua) to wo shakhs jo Tufail raziyallahu anhu ke saath aaya tha beemar ho gaya aur takleef ke maaray us ne apni ungliyon ke jor kaat daalay to us ke donon haathon se khoon bana shuru ho gaya donon haathon se yahan tak ke wo mar gaya phir Tufail raziyallahu anhu ne usay khwab mein dekha aur us ki haalat achi thi magar apne donon haathon ko chhupaye hue tha Tufail raziyallahu anhu ne poocha ke tere Rab ne tere saath kiya sulook kiya us ne kaha : mujhe us liye bakhsh diya ke mein ne us ke paighambar ki taraf hijrat ki thi Tufail raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke kiya wajah hai ke mein dekhta hun ke to apne donon haath chhupaye hue hai wo bola ke mujhe hukm hua hai ke ham us ko nahi sanwaarein ge jis ko to ne khud bakhud bigaara hai phir ye khwab Tufail raziyallahu anhu ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se bayan kiya to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ae Allah ! us ke donon haathon ko bhi bakhsh de jaisay to ne us ke saaray badan par karam kiya hai (us ke donon haathon ko bhi durust kar de)"
"98","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` jis waqt ye aayat naazil hui ke ” apne qareebi rishta daaron ko darrayie “ (ash-Shuara : 214) to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Quraish ke logon ko bulaya wo sab ikathay hue to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne (pehle) sab ko bil-umoom darraya aur phir khaas kiya (yani naam le kar un logon ko) aur farmaya ke Ae Ka'b bin loyi ke beto ! apne Aap ko jahannam se bachao Ae Murra bin Ka'b ke beto ! apne Aap ko jahannam se bachao Ae Abd Shams ke beto ! apne Aap ko jahannam se bachao Ae Hashim ke beto ! apne Aap ko jahannam se chhurao Ae Muttalib ke beto ! apne Aap ko jahannam se bachao Ae Fatima (raziyallahu anha) ! apne Aap ko jahannam se bachao us liye ke mein Allah ke saamnay kuch ikhtiyar nahi rakhta (yani agar wo azaab karna chahay to mein bacha nahi sakta) albatta tum jo naata mujh se rakhtay ho us ko mein jorta rahun ga (yani duniya mein tumharay saath ehsaan karta rahun ga)"
"99","[AI-translation] ´Abbas bin Muttalib raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke` unhon ne kaha Ae Allah ke Rasool ! kiya Aap ne Abu Talib ko bhi kuch faida pahunchaya wo Aap ki hifazat kartay thay aur Aap ke wastay ghussa hotay thay (yani jo koi Aap ko sataata to us par ghussa hotay thay) Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ” haan “ wo jahannam ke upar ke darja mein hain aur agar mein na hota (yani mein un ke liye dua na karta) to wo jahannam ke neechay ke darjay mein hotay (jahan azaab bohat sakht hai)"
"100","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : sab se halka azaab Abu Talib ko ho ga wo do aisi jootiyan pehnay ho ga ke jin se us ka dimaagh khole ga (jaisay handiya mein pani kholta hai)"
"101","[AI-translation] ´Husain bin Abdur Rahman raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` mein Sa'eed bin Jubair raziyallahu anhu ke paas tha unhon ne kaha ke tum mein se kis ne us sitara ko dekha jo kal raat ko toota tha mein ne kaha ke mein ne dekha ke mein kuch namaz mein mashghool na tha (us se ye gharz hai ke koi mujhe aabid shab bedaar na khayal karay) balke mujhe bichhu ne dang maara tha (to mein sau na saka aur taara toottay hue dekha) Sa'eed raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke phir to ne kiya kiya mein ne kaha ke mein ne dam karoaya unhon ne kaha ke to ne dam kyun karaya mein ne kaha ke us hadees ki wajah se jo Sha'bi ne ham se bayan ki unhon ne kaha ke Sha'bi ne kaun si hadees bayan ki mein ne kaha ke unhon ne ham se Buraida bin Husaib Aslami raziyallahu anhu ki hadees bayan ki unhon ne kaha ke dam faida nahi deta magar nazar ke liye ya dang ke liye (yani bad nazar ke asar ko door karnay ke liye ya bichhu aur saanp waghera ke kaate ke liye mufeed hai) Sa'eed raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke jis ne suna aur us par amal kiya to acha kiya lekin ham se to Abdullah bin Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ne hadees bayan ki unhon ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke mere saamnay paighambaron ki ummatein layi gayein baaz paighambar aisa tha ke us ki ummat ke log das se bhi kam thay aur baaz paighambar ke saath aik ya do hi aadmi thay aur baaz ke saath aik bhi na tha itnay mein aik bari ummat aayi mein samjha ke ye meri ummat hai mujh se kaha gaya ke ye Musa alaihissalam aur un ki ummat hai tum aasmaan ke kinaaray ko dekho mein ne dekha to aik aur bara giroh hai phir mujh se kaha gaya ke ab doosray kinaaray ki taraf dekho mein ne dekha to aik aur bara giroh hai mujh se kaha kiya ke ye tumhari ummat hai aur un logon mein satr hazaar aadmi aisay hain ke jo baghair hisab aur azaab ke jannat mein jayein ge phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam kharay ho gaye aur apne ghar tashreef le gaye to logon ne un logon ke baaray mein guftagu ki jo baghair hisab aur azaab ke jannat mein jayein ge baazon ne kaha ke shayad wo log hain jo Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki sohbat mein rahay baaz ne kaha nahi shayad wo log hain jo Islam ki haalat mein paida hue aur unhon ne Allah ke saath kisi ko shareek nahi kiya baaz ne kuch aur kaha itnay mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam bahar tashreef laaye aur farmaya ke tum log kis cheez mein behes kar rahay ho unhon ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko khabar di to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke wo log hain jo na dam kartay hain aur na dam rakhtay hain na dam karatay hain aur na badshagoon letay hain aur apne Rab par bharosa kartay hain ye sun kar Ukaasha bin Mihsan raziyallahu anhu kharay hue aur kaha ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Allah se dua kijiye ke wo mujhe un logon mein se kar de Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke to unhi logon mein se hai phir aik aur shakhs khara hua aur kehnay laga ke mere liye bhi dua kijiye ke Allah mujhe bhi unhi logon mein karay to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ukaasha raziyallahu anhu tujh se pehle ye kaam kar chuka"
"102","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` ham Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath aik khema mein thay jis mein taqreeban chaalees aadmi hun ge Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke kiya tum us baat se khush ho ke ahl jannat ke chauthayi tum log ho ham ne kaha haan phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tum us baat se khush ho ke ahl jannat ke aik tihayi tum ho ham ne kaha haan Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke qasam us zaat ki jis ke haath mein Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki jaan hai mujhe umeed hai ke tum jannatiyon ke aadhay hun ge aur ye us liye ke jannat mein wohi jaye ga jo Musalman hai aur Musalman mushrikon ke andar aisay hain jaisay aik safed baal siyah bail ki khaal mein ho ya aik surkh bail ki khaal mein aik siyah baal ho"
"103","[AI-translation] ´Abu Sa'eed Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Allah Taala farmaye ga ke Ae Adam ! wo kahein ge ke haazir hun teri khidmat mein aur teri itaat mein aur sab bhalayi tere haath mein hai hukm ho ga ke dozakhiyon ki jamaat nikaalo wo arz karein ge ke dozakhiyon ki kaisi jamaat hukm ho ga ke har hazaar aadmiyon mein se no sau ninanway aadmi jahannam ke liye nikaalo (aur aik aadmi fi hazaar jannat mein jaye ga) Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke yehi to waqt hai jab bacha boorha ho jaye ga (bawaja haul aur khauf ke ya us din ki lambii ki wajah se) ” aur har aik pait wali aurat apna pait daal de gi aur to logon ko dekhay ga ke jaisay nasha mein mast hain aur wo mast na hun ge lekin Allah ka azaab bohat sakht hai “ (Hajj : 2) sahaba us amr ke sun-nay se bohat pareshaan hue aur kehnay lagay ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! dekhyie us hazaar mein se aik aadmi (jo jinti hai) ham mein se kaun nikalta hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tum khush ho jao ke Yajooj Majooj ke kafir us qadar hain ke agar un ka hisab karo to tum mein se aik aadmi aur un mein se hazaar aadmi parein phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke qasam us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai mujhe umeed hai ke jannat ke aik chauthayi aadmi tum mein se hun ge us par ham ne Allah ki tareef ki aur takbeer kahi phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke qasam hai us ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai mujhe umeed hai ke jannat ke tihayi aadmi tum mein se hun ge us par ham ne Allah Taala ki tareef ki aur kibriyaayi bayan ki phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke qasam hai mujhe us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai ! mujhe umeed hai ke jannat ke aadhay aadmi tum mein se hun ge tumhari misaal aur ummaton ki misaal aisi hai jaisay aik safed baal siyah bail ki khaal mein ho ya aik nishan gadhay ke paon mein"
